INSERT INTO kb_planet_in_sign (planet, sign, summary, life_patterns, relationships, challenges, growth, book_references) VALUES

-- SUN IN SIGNS
('Sun', 'Aries', $$You burn with directness and impulse. Your core identity is about initiation—you''re built to start things, take risks, and lead from the front. Courage and competitive drive define you. You''re at your best when you''re blazing a trail.$$, $$You jump into projects headfirst. You''re the first to volunteer, speak up in meetings, or suggest a new direction. You move fast and get impatient with delay. People know exactly where you stand because you don''t hide your opinions.$$, $$You want a partner who can match your speed and isn''t intimidated by your directness. You can come across as self-centered when you''re not checking in emotionally. You''re attracted to independence in others and need someone who isn''t clingy.$$, $$Your impulsiveness can burn bridges before you realize what happened. You can steamroll people without noticing. Patience feels impossible, and you''re prone to starting more than you finish. You struggle when you''re not in charge.$$, $$Practice pausing for three seconds before you speak or act. Channel your pioneering energy into one main goal instead of scattering. Lead by inviting others in, not by dominating. Your courage is your gift—use it to help, not just to win.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Sun', 'Taurus', $$You are steady, present, and grounded in your body and the physical world. Your core identity is reliability—people build their plans around you. You move at your own pace and don''t rush. Stability and sensory experience are non-negotiable.$$, $$You show up the same way every day. You''re the person people call when they need something done right, not fast. You notice textures, tastes, comfort. You''re not rushed by others'' timelines. Your workspace or home reflects your values—it''s intentional and well-made.$$, $$You''re loyal and patient in love, but possessive when you feel threatened. You need reassurance and consistency from a partner. You''re physical and tactile, and you show love through presence and reliability. You''re slow to trust but deeply bonded once you do.$$, $$Your stubbornness can calcify into refusal to change. You can become so attached to comfort that you stop growing. Material security can become your only measure of worth. You struggle with loss and letting go.$$, $$Practice flexibility in small ways—take a new route, try an unfamiliar food. Understand that stability comes from inside you, not just from external things. Use your steadiness to support others'' growth, not to keep them small. Your reliability is powerful when paired with adaptability.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Sun', 'Gemini', $$Your core identity is curiosity and connection. You move through the world by learning, communicating, and linking ideas together. You''re endlessly interested in how things work and what other people think. Your mind is your primary tool.$$, $$You ask questions constantly. You juggle multiple projects, conversations, and interests at once. You''re the connector who knows everyone and remembers details. You change your mind regularly because you''re exposed to new information. People come to you for information and perspective.$$, $$You''re playful and mentally stimulated by partners—boredom kills attraction fast. You can seem distant because you''re in your head. You communicate a lot but sometimes avoid emotional depth. You need a partner who can match your intellectual pace and curiosity.$$, $$You scatter your energy across too many things and finish nothing. You can be superficial, skimming surfaces without going deep. Your curiosity can become gossip or restlessness. You fear commitment because it feels limiting. You use words to avoid feeling.$$, $$Pick three things and commit to them fully. Go deeper with people instead of collecting connections. Practice listening more than talking. Understand that commitment deepens life, not narrows it. Use your communication gifts to help others understand themselves.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Sun', 'Cancer', $$Your core identity is rooted in feeling and belonging. You''re naturally attuned to emotion—your own and everyone else''s. Family and home are where you build your sense of self. You lead through empathy and care.$$, $$You notice moods in a room before words are spoken. You''re protective of people you love and create safe spaces around you. You retreat when hurt, needing time alone to process. Your home is your sanctuary, decorated and organized to your emotional needs. You remember people''s stories and histories.$$, $$You''re devoted to partners and family, sometimes to your own detriment. You can be clingy or overly focused on others'' emotional states. You need consistent reassurance that you''re loved. Rejection wounds you deeply. You show love through care, cooking, and creating comfort.$$, $$You can be moody and pull away suddenly. Your sensitivity becomes oversensitivity and you take things personally. You use guilt or withdrawal to manage relationships. You struggle to set boundaries because you absorb everyone''s emotions. Self-pity can trap you.$$, $$Set emotional boundaries—you cannot heal everyone. Create rituals that nourish you so you''re not dependent on others'' approval. Face conflict gently but directly. Understand that your emotional depth is a strength, not a burden to others. Your nurturing nature is powerful when you also care for yourself.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Sun', 'Leo', $$Your core identity is creative self-expression and heart. You''re meant to shine and share your gifts with the world. You move from genuine generosity and warmth, not vanity. Authenticity and courage define you.$$, $$You stand out naturally—people''s eyes go to you. You speak with conviction and create things that feel true to you. You''re generous with friends and loved ones, giving freely. You need an audience or at least acknowledgment for what you do. You''re warm and direct with people.$$, $$You''re passionate and loyal in love, but need admiration to sustain attraction. You give your whole heart but expect reciprocal devotion. You''re playful and romantic. You can be possessive because love feels like a performance where you need to win. You''re generous with partners.$$, $$Your need for validation can become narcissism. You struggle when you''re not the center of attention. Your pride makes it hard to admit mistakes or weakness. You can be melodramatic or controlling in relationships. You fear irrelevance.$$, $$Perform for love, not for approval. Create your art or ideas because they matter to you, not for recognition. Practice genuine interest in others'' stories and talents. Understand that your heart''s warmth is your real power, not your visibility. Humility makes your generosity real.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Sun', 'Virgo', $$Your core identity is discernment and service. You''re built to analyze, organize, and improve systems and situations. Your mind is sharp and practical. You lead through competence and attention to detail.$$, $$You notice what''s broken or inefficient and fix it automatically. You organize your space and time carefully. You''re critical—of yourself first, then others. You give practical help and sound advice. You''re humble about your abilities even though you''re highly skilled.$$, $$You''re reliable and thoughtful in relationships, but can nitpick or seem cold. You show love through acts of service and practical help. You struggle with vulnerability because it feels messy. You need a partner who doesn''t need constant emotional reassurance. You''re loyal but reserved.$$, $$Your criticism becomes harsh and you focus on flaws over strengths. You get trapped in perfectionism and paralyzed by details. You''re so focused on what''s wrong that you miss what''s working. You struggle to relax or have fun. You can shame yourself and others.$$, $$Practice praising yourself and others for effort, not just results. Distinguish between useful discernment and destructive criticism. Do imperfect things on purpose—leave the dishes, make mistakes in public. Understand that your precision is a gift when paired with compassion. Service is noble only when it''s mutual.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Sun', 'Libra', $$Your core identity is balance and relationship. You''re naturally attuned to harmony and see multiple perspectives easily. You move toward partnership and fairness. Your sense of self is often reflected back through others.$$, $$You weigh options carefully and can see validity in conflicting viewpoints. You''re graceful socially and put people at ease. You hate conflict and go out of your way to keep peace. You''re drawn to beauty and aesthetic harmony. You consult others before deciding.$$, $$You thrive in partnership and can feel incomplete alone. You''re charming and considerate, adapting to partners'' needs. You struggle with your own needs because you''re so focused on balance. You can be indecisive or passive-aggressive to avoid confrontation. You need a partner who brings clarity.$$, $$You''re so focused on what others want that you lose yourself. Indecision becomes your default and you blame others for it. You people-please to the point of resentment. You struggle with conflict and avoid necessary conversations. Charm can become manipulation.$$, $$Make decisions alone, even small ones. Practice voicing disagreement gently but clearly. Understand that balance doesn''t mean everyone stays happy—it means you all stay authentic. Set boundaries because boundaries create real harmony. Your ability to see both sides is powerful when you also know what you stand for.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Sun', 'Scorpio', $$Your core identity is intensity and transformation. You move through the world with penetrating insight and emotional depth. Nothing is surface-level for you. Power dynamics, hidden truth, and the depths fascinate you.$$, $$You see what others miss—their motivations, shadows, fears. You''re magnetic and people either trust you completely or fear you. You''re private about yourself but invasive with others'' secrets. You''re relentless when pursuing something. You''re loyal to your people and ruthless with enemies.$$, $$You''re deeply feeling and sexually magnetized in love. You demand total honesty and complete commitment. You can become obsessive and jealous. You''re perceptive about partners'' flaws and use that knowledge strategically. You''re all-in or completely out—no middle ground.$$, $$Your intensity becomes controlling and you probe too deeply. Your need for power can make you manipulative. You hold grudges forever and plot revenge. You''re paranoid about betrayal and create it through suspicion. You destroy relationships through emotional extremism.$$, $$Practice trust even when it feels unsafe. Share your vulnerabilities, not just your perceptions. Use your insight to help others grow, not to gain power. Understand that transformation is your gift—apply it to yourself first. Release grudges because they bind you, not them.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Sun', 'Sagittarius', $$Your core identity is expansion and truth-seeking. You''re driven to explore—physically, intellectually, spiritually. You see the big picture and believe in growth and possibility. Optimism and adventure are your native state.$$, $$You move toward new experiences and new people. You''re enthusiastic and inspire others with your vision. You make plans and follow them through with optimism. You''re blunt because you believe in directness. You''re restless with routine and need room to roam.$$, $$You''re idealistic in love and expect partners to grow with you. You''re playful but also want philosophical depth. You can be unfaithful because commitment feels limiting. You''re honest to the point of bluntness, sometimes hurting partners. You need freedom more than security.$$, $$Your optimism becomes naivety and you overlook real problems. Your bluntness is cruel and you justify it as honesty. You start things you don''t finish because the next adventure calls. You''re irresponsible with commitments and people''s feelings. You run from anything that feels restrictive.$$, $$Practice finishing what you start. Stay present with people and situations instead of always planning the next thing. Distinguish between truth and judgment—honesty without kindness is violence. Understand that commitment can be an adventure too. Your expansive vision is powerful when rooted in follow-through.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Sun', 'Capricorn', $$Your core identity is ambition and responsibility. You move toward mastery and tangible achievement. You understand systems and hierarchies naturally. Long-term success matters more than quick wins.$$, $$You work steadily toward goals and don''t get distracted by shortcuts. You''re organized and efficient. You dress and speak with formality. You respect authority and tradition. You''re private and don''t share personal details. You''re reliable but can seem cold.$$, $$You''re serious and slow to open in relationships. You show love through commitment and provision. You''re loyal once committed. You struggle with playfulness and can feel withdrawn emotionally. You need a partner who respects your ambition and doesn''t demand constant attention.$$, $$Your ambition becomes joylessness and you forget why you wanted success. You''re so controlled you can''t adapt. You withhold emotion and warmth, making relationships feel transactional. You sacrifice relationships for achievement. You''re depressive and cynical.$$, $$Celebrate small wins and not just final goals. Practice being wrong and imperfect at things you care about. Let people see your real self, not just your professional self. Understand that success means nothing without people to share it with. Your discipline is a gift when paired with presence.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Sun', 'Aquarius', $$Your core identity is innovation and detachment. You see the world differently and don''t need approval for your ideas. You''re drawn to concepts, groups, and the future. Objectivity and independence are your native state.$$, $$You question everything and resist conformity. You''re friendly but keep emotional distance. You''re drawn to unusual people and causes. You''re logical and can intellectualize feelings away. You''re visionary but often ahead of your time.$$, $$You''re loving but emotionally unavailable in relationships. You''re friendly but not intimate. You resist possessiveness from partners and give them freedom. You can seem cold or distant because you''re in your head. You need a partner who doesn''t demand emotional intensity.$$, $$Your detachment becomes emotional unavailability and you can''t connect. You intellectualize feelings instead of feeling them. Your need for independence makes you reject intimacy. You''re cold and dismissive of others'' emotions. You use logic to avoid responsibility for how you affect people.$$, $$Practice naming your feelings instead of analyzing them. Stay present in relationships instead of staying mentally detached. Understand that intimacy requires some vulnerability, not full merger. Your perspective is powerful when you also care about impact. Your independence is real freedom only when chosen, not forced.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Sun', 'Pisces', $$Your core identity is sensitivity and boundlessness. You absorb the world emotionally and spiritually. Meaning and connection matter more than facts. You''re naturally attuned to the unseen and the suffering.$$, $$You pick up on subtle feelings and atmospheres. You''re artistic or drawn to beauty, spirituality, or service. You''re compassionate and can''t ignore others'' pain. You lose yourself in fantasy, daydreams, or substances. Boundaries are unclear and you merge with people easily.$$, $$You''re romantic and idealize partners, then feel disappointed when they''re human. You''re empathic and can sense what partners need. You struggle with your own identity in relationships and adapt too much. You''re creative in love but also escapist. You need a partner who helps you stay grounded.$$, $$Your sensitivity becomes victimhood and you blame others for your pain. Your lack of boundaries makes you absorb everyone''s emotions. You escape into fantasy or addiction rather than face reality. You''re vague and hard to pin down. You use compassion to avoid accountability.$$, $$Set firm boundaries—you cannot save everyone. Spend time alone to distinguish your feelings from others''. Face the practical world, not just the spiritual one. Understand that your sensitivity is a gift when grounded in reality. Channel your compassion into specific service, not vague rescue missions.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

-- MOON IN SIGNS
('Moon', 'Aries', $$Your emotional nature is quick, reactive, and direct. You feel things intensely in the moment but move on fast. You need independence and autonomy in how you process and express feelings. Your inner world is impatient and assertive.$$, $$You react emotionally before thinking. You''re irritable when your needs aren''t met immediately. You need physical outlets—movement, exercise, projects. You can''t sit with feelings; you have to act on them. You''re impulsive in emotional choices.$$, $$You need partners who give you space and don''t demand constant emotional connection. You express love through action and directness, not sentiment. You can be harsh or cutting when hurt. You''re passionate but not patient with others'' emotional pace. You push partners away when they get too close.$$, $$Your emotions are uncontrolled tantrums sometimes. You hurt people with harsh words and don''t apologize quickly. You''re defensive and blame others for how you feel. You can''t sit with disappointment. You''re self-centered emotionally.$$, $$Count to ten before you speak from emotion. Move your body daily to process feelings. Practice naming what you feel instead of acting it out. Understand that patience with others'' feelings is strength, not weakness. Your emotional honesty is powerful when not weaponized.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Moon', 'Taurus', $$Your emotional nature is steady, sensual, and attached. You process feelings slowly and need time to move through them. You''re soothed by comfort, physical touch, and familiar routines. You''re loyal emotionally and struggle with change.$$, $$You seek comfort and create cozy spaces. You''re not rushed and your moods are consistent. You need physical affection to feel secure. You''re stubborn about your feelings and hard to budge once you''ve decided something. You remember hurts for years.$$, $$You''re steady and loyal in relationships but possessive. You need constant reassurance that the relationship is secure. You''re physical and express love through presence and touch. You can be jealous and clingy. You''re slow to forgive because you hold grudges.$$, $$Your stubbornness makes you refuse to communicate or compromise. You hold onto resentment and it festers. You''re inflexible about emotional needs and expect others to adapt. You''re clingy and demanding of reassurance. Your need for security becomes paranoia.$$, $$Practice letting go of small hurts instead of storing them. Increase your sources of comfort—don''t rely only on one person. Move your body to shift stuck feelings. Understand that the world won''t change, but you can adapt. Your loyalty is beautiful when not possessive.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Moon', 'Gemini', $$Your emotional nature is curious, changeable, and communicative. You process feelings by talking and thinking. You ''re mentally engaged with emotions but can be emotionally detached. Your moods shift quickly and you move on easily.$$, $$You talk through your feelings constantly. You''re curious about others'' emotional lives and ask questions. Your moods are variable and you''re not consistently one way. You''re restless emotionally and bored by deep dwelling. You intellectualize feelings instead of feeling them fully.$$, $$You need intellectual compatibility with partners and stimulation. You''re communicative about feelings but not deeply vulnerable. You can seem detached or flaky emotionally. You''re curious about partners but can be gossipy about their secrets. You need variety and get bored easily.$$, $$You use words to avoid real emotional connection. You talk about feelings instead of experiencing them. Your inconsistency is confusing and exhausting to partners. You''re flaky and don''t follow through on emotional needs. You spread yourself thin emotionally.$$, $$Practice sitting with one feeling instead of talking your way out of it. Listen to others'' feelings without immediately responding. Commit to emotional consistency even when it feels boring. Understand that depth doesn''t require endless analysis. Your communicativeness is powerful when you also listen deeply.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Moon', 'Cancer', $$Your emotional nature is deeply feeling, protective, and moody. You absorb everyone''s emotions and create safe spaces. Your inner world is rich and tied to family and home. You''re sensitive to rejection and need constant reassurance.$$, $$You''re in touch with your feelings and others''. You''re moody and withdrawn sometimes, needing alone time. You create comfort and safety around you. You remember emotional histories and hold grudges. You''re nurturing but can be clingy.$$, $$You need emotional intimacy and constant reassurance in relationships. You''re devoted but can be suffocating. You''re sensitive to partners'' moods and absorb their emotions. You struggle to set boundaries. You''re hurt easily and withdraw to punish. You show love through care and comfort.$$, $$Your emotions overwhelm you and you become paralyzed. You use guilt and withdrawal to control relationships. You''re so sensitive you misinterpret neutral actions as rejection. You''re clingy and demanding of reassurance. Your moodiness exhausts partners.$$, $$Set emotional boundaries—you''re responsible for your own feelings, not others''. Create rituals that soothe you independent of people. Practice naming what you''re actually hurt about. Understand that reassurance is needed sometimes, but you must also reassure yourself. Your emotional depth is your strength when you don''t drown in it.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Moon', 'Leo', $$Your emotional nature is warm, proud, and needs to be seen. You feel things dramatically and want acknowledgment. Your inner world is generous but also self-focused. You''re loyal but need reciprocal devotion.$$, $$You express emotions openly and grandly. You need attention and recognition for your feelings. You''re warm and generous emotionally. You can be melodramatic and make situations about yourself. You''re playful and fun but also proud.$$, $$You need partners to admire and appreciate you emotionally. You''re generous with love and expect reciprocal devotion. You''re passionate and romantic. You can be controlling about how partners express affection. You need constant validation.$$, $$You need so much emotional validation that you''re exhausting. You take criticism personally and retaliate. You''re possessive and jealous. You''re dramatic and blow things out of proportion. You''re self-centered emotionally.$$, $$Practice receiving love without constant validation. Do things for your own joy, not for recognition. Appreciate partners'' quiet affection, not just grand gestures. Understand that your warmth is powerful when not contingent on being the center. Your generosity is real when others'' feelings matter equally.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Moon', 'Virgo', $$Your emotional nature is analytical, cautious, and reserved. You process feelings mentally and prefer to understand them logically. You''re helpful but distant emotionally. Your inner world is critical and perfectionistic.$$, $$You analyze your emotions rather than just feeling them. You''re helpful and notice what people need. You''re reserved emotionally and don''t overshare. You worry and ruminate. You''re critical of yourself and others'' emotional expressions.$$, $$You''re reliable in relationships but withhold emotional warmth. You show love through acts of service, not sentiment. You''re uncomfortable with emotional neediness. You can seem cold or rejecting. You need partners who don''t demand constant emotional reassurance.$$, $$Your emotional reserve makes relationships feel cold. You criticize partners'' emotions instead of supporting them. You''re so analytical you can''t feel anything. Your helpfulness is exhausting because it comes with judgment. You shame yourself and others for emotional needs.$$, $$Practice feeling emotions without analyzing them. Express appreciation verbally, not just through action. Accept that emotions aren''t problems to solve. Understand that vulnerability requires risk. Your discernment is powerful when paired with compassion for emotional messiness.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Moon', 'Libra', $$Your emotional nature is balanced, diplomatic, and people-focused. You''re attuned to others'' feelings and adjust yourself accordingly. Your inner world seeks peace and harmony. You struggle with your own emotional needs.$$, $$You notice tension and work to smooth it. You''re pleasant and agreeable emotionally. You weigh options before expressing feelings. You adapt your emotions to fit the situation. You avoid conflict and don''t express anger easily.$$, $$You need harmony in relationships and avoid confrontation. You''re considerate but also passive about your own needs. You''re charming but emotionally shallow sometimes. You struggle to know what you really feel under your diplomacy. You need partners who push you to be real.$$, $$Your emotional people-pleasing is exhausting and inauthentic. You lose your own feelings trying to keep peace. You''re passive-aggressive because you can''t express anger directly. You resent partners for not magically knowing your needs. Your politeness masks anger.$$, $$Express your real feelings even if they''re uncomfortable. Practice disagreement gently but clearly. Stop adapting your emotions to fit others'' comfort. Understand that conflict resolved is better than peace avoided. Your harmony-seeking is powerful when your authentic feelings matter too.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Moon', 'Scorpio', $$Your emotional nature is intense, private, and secretive. You feel everything deeply but share little. Your inner world is complex and you''re suspicious of others'' motives. You''re loyal to a few and guarded with everyone else.$$, $$You''re emotionally self-contained and don''t show feelings easily. You observe others'' motives carefully. You''re private about your inner world. You''re jealous and possessive when you care about someone. You hold grudges forever.$$, $$You need deep emotional intimacy but make it hard to achieve. You''re jealous and suspicious in relationships. You want total honesty from partners but don''t reciprocate. You''re passionate but controlling. You test partners'' loyalty constantly.$$, $$Your jealousy and suspicion poison relationships. You''re emotionally manipulative and use what you know against people. You''re all-in or completely out—no middle ground. You destroy relationships through emotional intensity. You''re paranoid and see betrayal everywhere.$$, $$Share your vulnerabilities, not just your suspicions. Trust even when it doesn''t feel safe. Use your emotional insight to help, not to manipulate. Understand that intimacy requires letting go of control. Your depth is powerful when you''re also willing to be known.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Moon', 'Sagittarius', $$Your emotional nature is optimistic, restless, and independent. You don''t dwell in feelings and quickly move forward. Your inner world is expansive but sometimes avoids real depth. You need freedom and don''t like being emotionally constrained.$$, $$You''re upbeat and optimistic emotionally. You don''t ruminate or get depressed easily. You''re restless and need new experiences emotionally. You''re blunt about your feelings. You don''t need constant emotional connection from others.$$, $$You need partners who give you emotional space. You''re loving but not clingy. You''re honest about your feelings but can be hurtful. You can seem cold because you move on quickly from emotional situations. You struggle with sustained commitment.$$, $$Your emotional avoidance keeps you from real intimacy. You use optimism to bypass real problems. Your bluntness is cruel and you justify it as honesty. You run from relationships when they require emotional depth. You''re irresponsible emotionally.$$, $$Stay present with difficult emotions instead of running. Practice listening to others'' feelings without fixing or joking. Understand that emotional commitment is an adventure too. Distinguish between optimism and denial. Your freedom-loving nature is powerful when you also choose to stay.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Moon', 'Capricorn', $$Your emotional nature is controlled, serious, and reserved. You don''t show feelings easily and process them privately. Your inner world is logical and responsible. You struggle with vulnerability and emotional expression.$$, $$You''re emotionally self-contained and private. You feel responsible for managing your own emotions and others''. You''re serious and formal about feelings. You don''t open up easily. You''re depressive and can get cynical.$$, $$You need partners who don''t demand constant emotional attention. You''re loyal but reserved. You''re uncomfortable with neediness in partners. You show love through commitment and provision, not sentiment. You struggle to express affection.$$, $$Your emotional withdrawal makes relationships feel cold and transactional. You''re so controlled you can''t connect. You''re depressive and isolate. You use responsibility as an excuse to avoid feeling. You shame yourself and others for emotional needs.$$, $$Practice expressing feelings, even small ones. Cry, laugh, be visibly moved by things. Understand that emotional expression is not weakness. Your feelings are important, not just your actions. Your stability is powerful when you also let yourself feel.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Moon', 'Aquarius', $$Your emotional nature is detached, objective, and intellectual. You process feelings mentally and keep emotional distance. Your inner world is unconventional but hard to access. You need independence and don''t like emotional neediness.$$, $$You''re emotionally cool and analytical. You distance yourself from messy feelings. You''re friendly but not intimate. You''re emotionally independent and don''t rely on others. You''re curious about others'' feelings but don''t share yours easily.$$, $$You need partners who don''t demand emotional intensity. You''re loving but cold. You''re independent and resist emotional demands. You can seem detached and unfeeling. You struggle with physical affection and emotional vulnerability.$$, $$Your emotional detachment is alienating and makes relationships feel lonely. You intellectualize feelings instead of feeling them. You''re emotionally unavailable no matter how much others try. Your independence becomes emotional unavailability. You''re cold and dismissive.$$, $$Practice naming your feelings instead of analyzing them. Allow yourself to be moved emotionally. Understand that intimacy requires vulnerability, not full merger. Your objectivity is powerful when paired with genuine care. Your need for space is real—also practice staying present.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Moon', 'Pisces', $$Your emotional nature is empathic, porous, and boundaryless. You absorb others'' feelings easily and become confused about what''s yours. Your inner world is rich, imaginative, and spiritual. You''re sensitive and need gentle handling.$$, $$You pick up on others'' feelings automatically. You''re artistic and drawn to beauty. You''re compassionate and can''t ignore suffering. You lose yourself in others'' emotions. Your boundaries are unclear and you merge with people.$$, $$You need partners who help you stay grounded. You''re empathic and can sense what partners need. You''re romantic and idealize partners. You struggle with your own identity in relationships. You''re creative in love but escapist.$$, $$Your emotional permeability means you absorb everyone''s pain. You lose yourself in relationships and relationships in you. You escape into fantasy or substances instead of facing reality. You''re vague about your own feelings. Your compassion becomes victimhood.$$, $$Set firm emotional boundaries. Spend time alone to distinguish your feelings from others''. Practice being responsible for your own emotions. Understand that you cannot save everyone. Your empathy is powerful when you also take care of yourself.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

-- MERCURY IN SIGNS
('Mercury', 'Aries', $$Your mind is quick, direct, and competitive. You think out loud and speak fast. You''re impatient with slow communication and go straight to the point. Your thinking is pioneering but not always thorough.$$, $$You talk a lot and interrupt people. You''re enthusiastic about ideas and pursue them immediately. You''re argumentative and enjoy debate. You''re curious but jump to conclusions. You''re not good at listening because you''re planning what to say next.$$, $$You''re witty and playful in conversation. You can be cutting or harsh with words. You lose interest in long explanations. You like partners who can match your verbal pace. You''re passionate about your ideas and want agreement.$$, $$Your impatience makes you miss important details. You speak without thinking and hurt people''s feelings. You''re dismissive of different perspectives. You start arguments you don''t finish. You''re so focused on winning you don''t hear what others say.$$, $$Pause before you speak. Ask questions and actually listen to answers. Write things down before arguing. Understand that thorough beats fast. Your directness is valuable when it includes curiosity about other views.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mercury', 'Taurus', $$Your mind is steady, practical, and fixed. You think things through carefully and don''t change your mind easily. You focus on what''s real and concrete. Your communication is reliable but sometimes rigid.$$, $$You speak slowly and deliberately. You''re not great at small talk but solid in substantial conversations. You''re practical and focus on results. You''re stubborn about your opinions. You remember everything people tell you.$$, $$You''re reliable in communication and follow through. You can be boring because you''re so literal. You struggle with abstract ideas. You''re possessive about your opinions. You need partners who appreciate your slow, steady style.$$, $$Your stubbornness makes you refuse new information. You''re inflexible and can''t adapt your thinking. You''re too literal and miss metaphor and nuance. You get stuck in outdated thinking. You''re defensive about your views.$$, $$Practice learning something new regularly. Listen to perspectives that challenge you. Use metaphor and poetry alongside facts. Understand that changing your mind is growth, not weakness. Your stability is powerful when paired with flexibility.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mercury', 'Gemini', $$Your mind is restless, curious, and connects everything. You''re interested in everything and learn quickly. Your thinking is flexible but can be scattered. You love ideas and communication above all.$$, $$You ask endless questions and change subjects frequently. You''re great with words and language. You''re bored easily and need constant mental stimulation. You make connections others miss. You''re gossipy and spread information quickly.$$, $$You''re witty and playful intellectually. You can seem shallow because you know a bit about everything but don''t go deep. You''re great at first conversations but struggle with depth. You need partners who match your intellectual pace.$$, $$You''re so scattered you start things you don''t finish. You spread yourself thin and master nothing. Your gossiping damages relationships. You use words to avoid real vulnerability. You can''t commit to any one thing.$$, $$Choose depth in a few areas over breadth in many. Complete projects before starting new ones. Listen more than you talk. Understand that mastery is possible for you. Your curiosity is powerful when paired with commitment.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mercury', 'Cancer', $$Your mind is intuitive, associative, and memory-focused. You think in pictures and feelings, not logic. You remember emotional histories and what people told you. Your communication is indirect and colored by feeling.$$, $$You ask questions to understand people''s motivations. You remember personal details about people. You think about the past frequently. You''re moody about ideas and your thinking shifts with your mood. You''re sensitive to criticism about your ideas.$$, $$You''re a good listener because you care about understanding. You can be clingy conversationally and want reassurance that people still care. You struggle with objective thinking. You take things personally. You need partners who are emotionally attuned to you.$$, $$Your emotionality makes you irrational. You use memories to prove your point instead of current evidence. You''re defensive about your ideas because you''ve internalized them. You manipulate with information you remember about people. You can''t be objective.$$, $$Distinguish between facts and feelings about those facts. Practice objective analysis of situations. Ask if your memory is accurate before using it as proof. Understand that logic and love aren''t opposites. Your memory is powerful when you use it kindly.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mercury', 'Leo', $$Your mind is dramatic, proud, and performance-focused. You think in narratives and want an audience for your ideas. You''re confident in your thinking but can be self-centered. Your communication is compelling and entertaining.$$, $$You speak with conviction and want agreement. You''re great at presentations and public speaking. You''re confident but can be condescending. You''re proud of your ideas and take criticism harshly. You want recognition for what you think.$$, $$You''re charismatic and engaging conversationally. You can monopolize conversations. You need partners to admire your intelligence. You''re generous with ideas but expect credit. You''re playful and fun to talk to.$$, $$Your pride makes you reject good feedback. You need so much intellectual validation you''re exhausting. Your dramatic thinking distorts reality. You''re condescending to people you think are less intelligent. You''re self-centered about ideas.$$, $$Practice receiving critical feedback without defensiveness. Listen to understand, not to respond. Appreciate others'' ideas without needing your own validated. Understand that great thinkers learn from everyone. Your confidence is powerful when you''re also humble.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mercury', 'Virgo', $$Your mind is analytical, precise, and improvement-focused. You notice flaws and inefficiencies automatically. Your thinking is logical and methodical. Your communication is clear but can be nitpicky.$$, $$You ask probing questions and catch inconsistencies. You''re great with data and systems. You''re critical of sloppy thinking. You''re quiet and observe before speaking. You''re not confident socially but solid in your competence.$$, $$You''re helpful and offer practical advice. You can be condescending about intelligence. You''re reliable in communication. You can seem cold because you''re so focused on accuracy. You need partners who don''t mind your critiques.$$, $$Your criticism is harsh and demotivating. You focus on flaws and miss strengths. You''re so focused on perfection that you''re paralyzed. You''re judgmental and shame-based in your thinking. You use precision as a weapon.$$, $$Praise what''s working alongside critiques. Accept "good enough" sometimes. Practice compliments without criticism. Understand that your discernment is a gift when it also builds people up. Your precision is powerful when paired with encouragement.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mercury', 'Libra', $$Your mind is balanced, diplomatic, and people-focused. You see multiple perspectives and present them fairly. Your thinking is elegant and you''re gifted at negotiation. Your communication is smooth but can lack decisiveness.$$, $$You present balanced arguments and consider all sides. You''re charming and make people comfortable. You don''t like confrontation and avoid expressing disagreement. You''re great in diplomacy and mediation. You''re indecisive because you see validity in everything.$$, $$You''re charming in communication and put people at ease. You''re good at seeing others'' perspectives. You can seem wishy-washy because you''re so balanced. You''re great at relationships because you listen well. You need partners who help you decide.$$, $$Your indecision is paralyzing and frustrating. You present so many sides that no one knows what you actually think. You avoid your real opinion to keep peace. You''re manipulatively diplomatic. You can''t take a stand.$$, $$Make decisions alone, even small ones. Express your actual opinion gently but clearly. Understand that balance doesn''t mean everyone''s always happy. Your ability to see multiple sides is powerful when you also know what you believe.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mercury', 'Scorpio', $$Your mind is penetrating, intense, and secretive. You see what others miss and understand hidden motivations. Your thinking is strategic and you play the long game. Your communication is sparse but potent.$$, $$You ask probing questions and see through lies. You''re private about your thoughts. You''re strategic and a few moves ahead. You''re fascinated by what''s hidden or taboo. You don''t say much but what you say lands hard.$$, $$You''re perceptive about partners and use that knowledge strategically. You''re magnetic and people are drawn to your intensity. You can be controlling conversationally and probe too deeply. You''re secretive about your thinking. You need partners who can keep up.$$, $$Your intensity is overwhelming and you probe inappropriately. You use information as a weapon. You''re paranoid about being tricked. You''re manipulative and strategic in conversations. You''re secretive and don''t reciprocate vulnerability.$$, $$Share your thinking, not just your insights. Practice curiosity without judgment. Use your perceptiveness to help, not to gain power. Understand that intimacy requires transparency from you too. Your intensity is powerful when you''re also honest.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mercury', 'Sagittarius', $$Your mind is expansive, optimistic, and philosophical. You see the big picture and believe in growth and learning. Your thinking is broad but sometimes lacks depth. Your communication is enthusiastic but often blunt.$$, $$You''re interested in big ideas and philosophical questions. You''re optimistic and see possibility. You speak your mind bluntly and don''t filter. You jump to conclusions quickly. You''re not good at details.$$, $$You''re engaging and fun to talk to because you''re interested in everything. You can be insensitive because you prioritize honesty over kindness. You''re great at starting conversations but not sustaining them. You need partners who share your vision.$$, $$Your bluntness is cruel and you justify it as honesty. You''re so big-picture you miss important details. Your optimism becomes naivety. You start many ideas you don''t finish. You''re irresponsible with information.$$, $$Think before you speak, especially about sensitive topics. Go deeper with ideas instead of always seeking the next thing. Practice tact alongside honesty. Understand that your expansiveness is powerful when also grounded in facts. Your optimism is beautiful when not dismissive of real problems.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mercury', 'Capricorn', $$Your mind is methodical, practical, and authority-focused. You think long-term and understand systems. Your thinking is serious and realistic. Your communication is formal and deliberate.$$, $$You''re strategic and think several moves ahead. You''re not great at small talk. You''re focused on practical results. You respect tradition and established knowledge. You''re quiet but command attention.$$, $$You''re reliable in your communication and follow through. You can seem cold or boring. You''re great with big decisions and strategy. You need partners who respect your serious nature. You''re not playful conversationally.$$, $$Your rigidity makes you closed to new ideas. You''re so formal you can''t connect casually. Your realistic thinking becomes cynicism. You''re depressive and dismissive of optimism. You''re stubbornly stuck in your ways.$$, $$Practice curiosity about new approaches. Be playful in conversations sometimes. Distinguish between realistic and pessimistic. Understand that innovation builds on tradition. Your strategist mind is powerful when also open to change.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mercury', 'Aquarius', $$Your mind is innovative, detached, and theory-focused. You see patterns others miss and think ahead of your time. Your thinking is original but sometimes impractical. Your communication is intellectual and group-oriented.$$, $$You''re interested in unusual ideas and future possibilities. You''re objective and can discuss anything unemotionally. You''re great with technology and systems. You don''t care what people think about your ideas. You can seem cold or weird.$$, $$You''re intellectually stimulating in relationships. You can seem emotionally unavailable because you''re in your head. You''re unconventional in your thinking. You need partners who don''t require constant emotional validation. You''re loyal but detached.$$, $$Your detachment makes you cold and unfeeling. Your ideas are too abstract to apply practically. You''re so objective you miss human impact. You''re strange and isolating socially. You use intellect to avoid emotion.$$, $$Connect your ideas to real-world impact. Practice emotional awareness alongside logic. Understand that your different perspective is powerful when communicated kindly. Your innovation is brilliant when also practical.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mercury', 'Pisces', $$Your mind is intuitive, imaginative, and non-linear. You think in symbols and feelings, not logic. Your thinking is creative and spiritual. Your communication is vague and easily misunderstood.$$, $$You understand things without knowing how you know. You''re creative and great with metaphor. You''re not linear and jump between ideas. You''re sensitive to criticism about your ideas. You can''t remember or explain your own thinking.$$, $$You''re poetic and imaginative in conversation. You can be vague and hard to pin down. You''re intuitive about partners'' feelings. You struggle with logical discussion. You need partners who appreciate your nebulous thinking.$$, $$Your vagueness causes misunderstandings constantly. You can''t back up your claims with facts. You escape into fantasy instead of engaging reality. You''re flaky and don''t follow through on what you say. Your thinking is impractical.$$, $$Practice explaining your intuitions clearly. Use logic and facts alongside intuition. Ground your ideas in reality. Understand that your imagination is powerful when also grounded. Your intuition is wisdom when paired with discernment.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

-- VENUS IN SIGNS
('Venus', 'Aries', $$Your heart is passionate, direct, and wants what it wants. You love intensely and pursue aggressively. You''re drawn to excitement and risk in relationships. Your desire is quick to ignite and quick to cool.$$, $$You''re affectionate physically and emotionally. You come on strong and move fast in romance. You''re not patient with slow burns or games. You''re fiercely independent even in love. You''re spontaneous and impulsive.$$, $$You''re passionate and direct about what you want. You can be selfish and focused on your own pleasure. You''re attracted to challenge and people who push back. You lose interest when the pursuit is over. You''re physically passionate but emotionally surface.$$, $$Your intensity burns relationships out quickly. You''re so focused on yourself you don''t notice partners'' needs. You''re reckless with people''s hearts. You leave a trail of hurt people. Your passion becomes aggression.$$, $$Slow down and stay present with one person. Notice what partners need, not just what you want. Understand that depth comes after the initial rush. Your passion is powerful when paired with consideration. Love is about the other person too.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Venus', 'Taurus', $$Your heart is stable, sensual, and devoted. You love steadily and don''t rush or play games. You''re drawn to physical comfort and emotional security. Your love is lasting but possessive.$$, $$You''re affectionate and physically sensual. You''re loyal and committed once you''ve decided. You move slowly in love but are solid. You''re possessive and jealous. You''re drawn to beauty and luxury.$$, $$You''re steady and reliable in love. You''re physically affectionate and love touch. You can be possessive and clingy. You''re jealous and insecure. You need constant reassurance. You''re generous but expect reciprocal devotion.$$, $$Your possessiveness is controlling and suffocating. You''re so attached you can''t let people be themselves. Your jealousy poisons relationships. You hold grudges forever. Your stubbornness makes compromise impossible.$$, $$Practice letting go of control. Give partners freedom and trust them. Distinguish between loyalty and possession. Understand that love doesn''t require ownership. Your steadiness is beautiful when not possessive. Your sensuality is powerful when also generous.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Venus', 'Gemini', $$Your heart is curious, playful, and easily bored. You''re drawn to mental connection and variety. You love many people in many ways but struggle with depth. Your affection is light and changeable.$$, $$You''re flirty and fun in relationships. You need mental stimulation and wit. You''re not physically passionate compared to other placements. You''re charming and put people at ease. You''re loyal but not intensely so.$$, $$You''re engaging and fun to be with. You can seem shallow because you skim surfaces. You''re interested in many people and can be unfaithful. You''re not great with commitment. You need intellectual compatibility.$$, $$Your inability to go deep means relationships lack intimacy. Your flirtatiousness hurts committed partners. You use words instead of presence. You''re fickle and unreliable. You can''t sustain love because you''re bored.$$, $$Choose depth with one person instead of breadth with many. Practice being present in conversations instead of scanning for the next interesting thing. Understand that intimacy requires commitment. Your playfulness is powerful when loyal. Your wit is beautiful when also emotionally present.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Venus', 'Cancer', $$Your heart is nurturing, sensitive, and needs to merge. You love protectively and create safe spaces. You''re drawn to family and home. Your love is conditional on feeling emotionally secure.$$, $$You''re nurturing and care for your people deeply. You need to feel secure and close. You''re moody in love and withdrawal is your weapon. You remember every hurt and hold grudges. You''re needy and cling to partners.$$, $$You''re devoted and will do anything for loved ones. You can be suffocating and controlling through care. You''re sensitive to rejection and withdraw. You''re clingy and demand constant reassurance. You merge too completely with partners.$$, $$Your neediness is exhausting and pushes partners away. Your moodiness is weaponized withdrawal. You manipulate with guilt and hurt. You smother people with care. Your boundaries are nonexistent.$$, $$Set boundaries—you''re not responsible for partners'' emotions. Create security from within, not just from others. Practice independence and self-care. Understand that love isn''t merger. Your nurturing is beautiful when not controlling. Your care is powerful when also respectful.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Venus', 'Leo', $$Your heart is generous, dramatic, and wants to be adored. You love grandly and want recognition for it. You''re drawn to passion and drama. Your love requires constant validation and attention.$$, $$You''re warm and generous in love. You''re romantic and want grand gestures. You need to be someone''s priority. You''re playful and fun. You can be self-centered about love.$$, $$You''re passionate and romantic. You can be controlling about how partners express love. You need constant admiration and validation. You''re generous but expect reciprocal devotion. You''re possessive.$$, $$Your need for admiration is exhausting and narcissistic. You''re so focused on being adored you miss partners'' needs. You''re jealous and possessive. Your drama is manipulative. Your generosity comes with strings.$$, $$Practice receiving love quietly without needing validation. Appreciate partners'' quiet affection, not just grand gestures. Focus on partners'' needs as much as your own. Understand that real love isn''t a performance. Your warmth is powerful when not contingent on adoration. Your generosity is genuine when unconditional.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Venus', 'Virgo', $$Your heart is selective, practical, and service-oriented. You''re cautious in love and slow to commit. You''re drawn to competence and reliability. Your love is expressed through service, not sentiment.$$, $$You''re reserved and don''t show affection easily. You''re loyal but not passionate. You''re practical about love and relationships. You''re helpful and do things for people. You''re judgmental about partners.$$, $$You''re reliable and loyal. You show love through acts of service. You can seem cold or critical. You''re uncomfortable with emotional demands. You''re judgmental about partners'' flaws. You struggle with physical passion.$$, $$Your coldness makes relationships feel transactional. You''re so critical that partners feel judged. You''re withholding of affection and warmth. Your service is exhausting because it comes with judgment. You shame yourself and others for needing love.$$, $$Practice expressing affection verbally and physically. Accept that love is sometimes impractical and messy. Distinguish between useful critique and shaming judgment. Understand that your reliability is powerful when paired with warmth. Your service is genuine when also vulnerable.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Venus', 'Libra', $$Your heart is romantic, diplomatic, and partnership-focused. You''re graceful in love and see both sides. You''re drawn to beauty and harmony. Your love is conditional on peace and balance.$$, $$You''re charming and put people at ease. You''re romantic and love the idea of love. You adapt to partners and prioritize their needs. You''re indecisive and can''t choose. You avoid conflict.$$, $$You''re charming and easy to love. You''re romantic and beautiful in relationships. You can seem shallow or people-pleasing. You lose yourself trying to keep peace. You''re indecisive and need partners'' input.$$, $$Your people-pleasing means you lose yourself completely. Your indecision is paralyzing and exhausting. You stay in bad relationships to keep peace. Your passivity is masked as diplomacy. You''re inauthentic about your own needs.$$, $$Choose what you want without polling partners. Express disagreement gently but clearly. Stop adapting yourself out of existence. Understand that real harmony includes authenticity. Your ability to see both sides is powerful when you also know what you stand for. Your beauty is real when also genuine.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Venus', 'Scorpio', $$Your heart is intense, secretive, and demands complete loyalty. You love obsessively and want to merge completely. You''re drawn to depth and taboo. Your love is conditional and you test constantly.$$, $$You''re magnetic and people are drawn to your intensity. You''re private about your affection. You''re jealous and possessive. You want complete honesty from partners but don''t reciprocate. You''re passionate sexually but controlling emotionally.$$, $$You''re deeply sexual and passionate. You demand complete loyalty and honesty. You''re jealous and suspicious. You''re perceptive about partners'' flaws and use that knowledge strategically. You test partners'' commitment constantly. You''re all-in or completely out.$$, $$Your jealousy poisons relationships. You''re emotionally manipulative and use what you know against people. Your intensity is suffocating and controlling. You destroy relationships through suspicion. Your secretiveness creates distance even in intimacy.$$, $$Practice trust even when unsafe. Share your vulnerabilities, not just your insights. Use your perceptiveness to help, not control. Understand that intimacy requires transparency from you. Your passion is powerful when also generous. Your depth is beautiful when you''re also willing to be known.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Venus', 'Sagittarius', $$Your heart is free, adventurous, and resistant to constraint. You love widely and lightly. You''re drawn to new experiences and people. Your love is conditional on freedom and growth.$$, $$You''re flirty and charming with many people. You''re fun and playful in love. You''re not jealous because you need freedom too. You can be unfaithful because commitment feels limiting. You''re optimistic about love but don''t stick around.$$, $$You''re fun and engaging. You''re playful and adventurous. You can be unreliable and flaky. You''re unfaithful because you lose interest. You need partners who give you freedom. You''re not great with commitment.$$, $$Your need for freedom makes you unable to commit. You hurt people by leaving when things get real. Your optimism masks avoidance of depth. Your playfulness is running away. You''re irresponsible with people''s hearts.$$, $$Practice staying through difficulty, not running to the next adventure. Commit to one person and find freedom within that. Distinguish between honesty and bluntness. Understand that true freedom includes chosen commitment. Your adventurousness is beautiful when also loyal. Your optimism is powerful when not dismissive of real problems.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Venus', 'Capricorn', $$Your heart is cautious, traditional, and commitment-focused. You take love seriously and move slowly. You''re drawn to stability and status. Your love is practical and long-term.$$, $$You''re reserved and don''t show affection easily. You''re serious about commitment and loyal for life. You''re uncomfortable with emotional displays. You''re traditional about relationships. You''re not romantic or playful.$$, $$You''re serious and loyal in love. You''re reliable and committed for the long term. You can seem cold and withheld emotionally. You''re uncomfortable with vulnerability. You show love through provision, not sentiment. You need partners who respect your serious nature.$$, $$Your coldness makes relationships feel transactional and joyless. You''re so controlled you can''t connect emotionally. You''re depressive and isolate. You use responsibility as an excuse to avoid feeling. You shame yourself and others for emotional needs.$$, $$Practice warmth and affection, even small gestures. Understand that love doesn''t require constant displays. Express your feelings, not just your commitments. Your stability is powerful when also warm. Your loyalty is beautiful when also affectionate.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Venus', 'Aquarius', $$Your heart is detached, unconventional, and friendship-based. You love intellectually and resist emotional intensity. You''re drawn to uniqueness and independence. Your love is conditional on freedom and shared ideals.$$, $$You''re attracted to unusual people. You''re friendly but emotionally distant. You''re not physically passionate. You need partners who don''t demand constant connection. You''re idealistic about relationships but struggle with real intimacy.$$, $$You''re friendly and engaging with partners. You can seem cold and emotionally unavailable. You value independence over connection. You''re not physically affectionate or passionate. You need intellectual compatibility. You struggle with commitment.$$, $$Your emotional distance makes relationships feel lonely. You intellectualize feelings instead of feeling them. You''re unavailable no matter how much partners try. You use independence as an excuse for unavailability. You''re cold and dismissive of emotional needs.$$, $$Practice being present emotionally in relationships. Allow yourself to be vulnerable and need someone. Understand that intimacy requires some surrender of independence. Your uniqueness is beautiful when you also connect deeply. Your idealism is powerful when also practical.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Venus', 'Pisces', $$Your heart is empathic, romantic, and boundary-dissolving. You love unconditionally and merge completely. You''re drawn to spiritual connection and rescue fantasies. Your love is idealistic but unrealistic.$$, $$You''re romantic and believe in soulmates. You''re empathic and absorb partners'' emotions. You''re creative and artistic. You''re prone to fantasy about relationships. You lose yourself in love. Your boundaries are nonexistent.$$, $$You''re romantic and tenderhearted. You''re empathic and intuitive about partners'' needs. You can be idealistic and disappointed when partners are human. You merge too completely with partners. You lose yourself in love. You''re creative and spiritual.$$, $$Your idealism creates fantasy relationships with real people. You lose yourself completely and relationship becomes codependency. You escape into fantasy or substances instead of facing reality. Your empathy becomes victimhood. You can''t set boundaries.$$, $$Set firm emotional boundaries. Spend time alone to distinguish yourself from partners. Practice being responsible for your own emotions. Understand that real love requires seeing partners clearly. Your empathy is powerful when also boundaried. Your romance is beautiful when also realistic.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

-- MARS IN SIGNS
('Mars', 'Aries', $$Your drive is raw, direct, and competitive. You move fast and initiate boldly. You want what you want and go after it without hesitation. Your assertiveness is your superpower but also your danger zone.$$, $$You''re the first to jump into action. You take on challenges aggressively. You''re quick-tempered and impatient with slowness. You get bored easily and need new conquests. You''re athletic or physically active. You move before thinking.$$, $$You''re sexually passionate and direct. You pursue aggressively and lose interest quickly. You can be selfish in bed. You can be verbally aggressive when frustrated. You''re attracted to challenge and partners who push back. You''re not patient with slow burns.$$, $$Your aggression damages relationships and careers. You''re impulsive and reckless. You start wars you don''t finish. You''re a bully when frustrated. Your impatience means you miss important details.$$, $$Pause before you act. Count to ten when angry. Channel your competitiveness into long-term goals. Understand that winning isn''t always the point. Your raw drive is powerful when also thoughtful.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mars', 'Taurus', $$Your drive is steady, persistent, and material-focused. You work relentlessly toward concrete goals. You have staying power others lack. Your assertiveness is grounded and builds real things.$$, $$You move slowly but don''t stop. You''re physically strong and capable. You''re not rushed by others'' timelines. You''re sensual and physically confident. You accumulate things—wealth, possessions, skills. You''re stubborn about your goals.$$, $$You''re physically passionate and sensual in bed. You have stamina and consistency. You''re not rushed or pressured. You can be possessive and jealous. You''re consistent and reliable. You''re drawn to financial stability in partners.$$, $$Your stubbornness makes you impossible to stop, even when you should. You''re so attached to your goals you become rigid. You accumulate things compulsively. You''re possessive and controlling. You''re inflexible.$$, $$Practice changing direction when needed. Distinguish between persistence and stubbornness. Let go of accumulation sometimes. Understand that flexibility is also strength. Your staying power is powerful when also adaptive.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mars', 'Gemini', $$Your drive is scattered, communicative, and quick-witted. You''re energized by variety and mental sparring. You move in multiple directions at once. Your assertiveness is verbal and strategic.$$, $$You talk a lot about what you''re going to do. You''re good at mental games and strategy. You jump between projects and interests. You''re restless and need constant stimulation. You''re not consistent or follow-through focused. You use words as weapons.$$, $$You''re playful and flirty sexually. You can be unfaithful because you need variety. You''re witty and engaging. You''re inconsistent in showing up. You like the chase more than the relationship. You argue and spar verbally.$$, $$Your inconsistency is frustrating and unreliable. You talk big but deliver small. You spread yourself thin and master nothing. Your verbal aggression is cutting and hurtful. You''re incapable of sustained effort.$$, $$Choose a few things and commit fully. Follow through on what you start. Practice listening more than talking. Understand that consistency matters more than ideas. Your wit is powerful when also responsible.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mars', 'Cancer', $$Your drive is protective, emotional, and family-focused. You fight for what you love and hold close. Your assertiveness is defensive and caring. Your anger comes from deep feeling, not impulse.$$, $$You''re protective of family and home. You get angry when people you love are hurt. You''re moody and withdrawn sometimes. You''re physically nurturing and hands-on. You hold grudges about emotional betrayals. You''re not aggressive overtly; you scheme.$$, $$You''re passionate sexually but need emotional safety. You can withdraw or give silent treatment when hurt. You''re protective and want to merge. You''re possessive about partners. You''re not cheaters because loyalty runs deep. You test partners'' commitment.$$, $$Your moodiness is weaponized withdrawal and punishment. You''re passive-aggressive and manipulative. You smother people with protection. Your anger is cold and calculated. You destroy relationships through emotional withdrawal.$$, $$Face conflict directly instead of withdrawing. Express your needs clearly, not through silent treatment. Distinguish between protection and control. Understand that your emotion is your strength, not your liability. Your loyalty is powerful when not possessive.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mars', 'Leo', $$Your drive is passionate, proud, and performance-driven. You want to win and be seen winning. You fight for recognition and glory. Your assertiveness is bold and theatrical.$$, $$You want to be the star or best at what you do. You''re ambitious and competitive. You''re physically passionate and athletic. You want recognition for your efforts. You''re generous but expect credit. You''re not okay with being overlooked.$$, $$You''re passionate and romantic sexually. You want to be your partner''s priority. You''re generous but need appreciation. You can be controlling about how you''re treated. You want partners who admire you. You''re playful and fun.$$, $$Your need for recognition is narcissistic and exhausting. You can''t stand being second. You''re selfish about your ego. You destroy relationships when not the center. Your passion becomes aggression when challenged. Your generosity comes with strings.$$, $$Practice doing things for your own joy, not recognition. Appreciate partners'' quiet support. Distinguish between healthy ambition and narcissism. Understand that real strength doesn''t need constant validation. Your passion is powerful when also humble. Your confidence is attractive when not arrogant.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mars', 'Virgo', $$Your drive is focused, strategic, and improvement-oriented. You work with precision toward practical goals. You''re efficient and don''t waste energy. Your assertiveness is subtle and strategic, not overtly aggressive.$$, $$You''re a worker bee who gets things done. You''re critical and notice what''s broken. You''re not overtly aggressive; you critique. You''re methodical and detail-focused. You''re healthy and fit because you''re disciplined. You''re judgmental about laziness.$$, $$You''re not physically passionate compared to other Mars placements. You need cleanliness and health in partners. You''re skilled and competent sexually. You can be critical and make partners feel inadequate. You''re reliable but not spontaneous. You focus on improvement.$$, $$Your criticism is harsh and demotivating. You''re so focused on flaws that you miss what''s working. You''re judgmental and shame-based. You''re passive-aggressive when frustrated. Your perfectionism is paralyzing for you and others.$$, $$Praise what''s working alongside critiques. Accept "good enough." Practice kindness when frustrated. Understand that effort matters more than perfection. Your precision is powerful when paired with compassion. Your competence is attractive when also accepting.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mars', 'Libra', $$Your drive is diplomatic, partnership-focused, and aesthetically motivated. You fight for fairness and harmony. You''re strategic and see multiple angles. Your assertiveness is graceful and persuasive.$$, $$You don''t like direct conflict and prefer diplomacy. You''re strategic and several moves ahead. You''re not overtly aggressive. You''re fair-minded and fight for justice. You''re drawn to beautiful things. You''re competitive but disguise it.$$, $$You''re charming and graceful sexually. You can be indirect and manipulative. You avoid direct confrontation even when needed. You''re not as sexually passionate as other Mars placements. You need intellectual connection with partners. You''re flirty and charming.$$, $$Your indirect approach is frustrating and passive-aggressive. You can''t have the hard conversation. You''re manipulative while seeming diplomatic. You avoid your own power. You lose arguments because you won''t fight. Your charm masks anger.$$, $$Have direct conversations even when uncomfortable. Express your needs clearly and assertively. Distinguish between diplomacy and avoidance. Understand that healthy conflict is possible. Your fairness is powerful when also assertive. Your grace is attractive when also genuine.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mars', 'Scorpio', $$Your drive is intense, strategic, and power-focused. You''re relentless in pursuing what you want. You''re willing to go to dark places others won''t. Your assertiveness is penetrating and transformative.$$, $$You''re a strategist who plays the long game. You''re willing to be ruthless. You''re magnetic and powerful. You don''t show your hand. You''re secretive about your goals. You have incredible focus and stamina. You''re not distracted.$$, $$You''re intensely sexual and magnetizing. You''re possessive and jealous. You can be controlling and manipulative. You''re perceptive about partners'' weaknesses and exploit them. You''re all-in or completely out. You''re not okay with casual.$$, $$Your intensity is suffocating and controlling. You''re manipulative and use secrets against people. You''re obsessive and paranoid. Your jealousy poisons relationships. Your power-seeking destroys everything. You''re ruthless and cruel.$$, $$Practice transparency and trust. Share your vulnerabilities. Use your power to help, not control. Understand that real power includes letting go. Your intensity is powerful when also honest. Your focus is attractive when also open.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mars', 'Sagittarius', $$Your drive is expansive, adventurous, and truth-seeking. You''re energized by new challenges and possibilities. You move toward freedom and growth. Your assertiveness is blunt and optimistic.$$, $$You''re always starting new things. You''re optimistic and take on big projects. You''re physically active and outdoorsy. You''re not afraid of risk. You''re blunt and direct. You''re restless and bored easily. You don''t finish things.$$, $$You''re sexually adventurous and playful. You''re not jealous and give partners freedom. You can be unfaithful because you need excitement. You''re fun and engaging. You''re not great with commitment because it feels limiting. You can be irresponsible.$$, $$Your need for freedom makes you unable to commit. You hurt people by leaving when things get real. Your bluntness is cruel and you justify it as honesty. Your optimism masks irresponsibility. Your adventures are running away.$$, $$Practice finishing what you start. Stay with one partner through difficulty. Distinguish between honesty and cruelty. Understand that real freedom includes chosen commitment. Your adventurousness is powerful when also loyal. Your optimism is attractive when also responsible.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mars', 'Capricorn', $$Your drive is relentless, ambitious, and status-focused. You work toward tangible success systematically. You have incredible discipline and patience. Your assertiveness is controlled and strategic.$$, $$You''re a machine when working toward goals. You''re disciplined and don''t get distracted. You''re not naturally athletic but you get fit through work. You''re formal and controlled. You respect hierarchy and authority. You''re not overtly aggressive.$$, $$You''re not naturally passionate sexually but consistent. You show love through provision and commitment. You''re serious and formal. You can seem cold emotionally. You''re reliable and loyal. You''re not spontaneous or playful.$$, $$Your drive for success is joyless and isolating. You work so much relationships suffer. You''re so controlled you can''t relax or connect. You''re depressive and cynical. You''ve sacrificed everything for achievement with nothing to show.$$, $$Celebrate small wins alongside big goals. Make time for play and pleasure. Connect emotionally with people. Understand that success means nothing without someone to share it. Your ambition is powerful when also warm. Your discipline is attractive when also playful.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mars', 'Aquarius', $$Your drive is unconventional, idealistic, and group-focused. You fight for causes and the future. You''re energized by innovation and change. Your assertiveness is intellectual and detached.$$, $$You''re drawn to unusual goals and people. You''re idealistic and want to change the world. You''re not physically aggressive; you argue ideologically. You''re stubborn about your beliefs. You''re friendly but emotionally distant. You don''t care if people approve.$$, $$You''re not naturally passionate sexually. You need intellectual connection with partners. You''re friendly but can seem cold emotionally. You can be unfaithful because you''re emotionally detached. You value freedom and independence. You''re idealistic about relationships.$$, $$Your detachment makes you emotionally unavailable. Your idealism is so strong you reject real people. Your independence is running away. You''re cold and dismissive. You use intellect to avoid feeling. You''re isolated.$$, $$Connect emotionally, not just intellectually. Allow yourself to feel passion and need. Understand that intimacy requires vulnerability. Your uniqueness is powerful when also grounded in reality. Your idealism is attractive when also compassionate.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Mars', 'Pisces', $$Your drive is diffuse, spiritual, and compassion-motivated. You fight for the weak and suffering. You''re energized by creativity and healing. Your assertiveness is subtle and indirect.$$, $$You''re driven by feeling, not logic. You''re protective of people who need help. You''re creative and driven to express yourself. You''re not confrontational and avoid direct conflict. You escape into fantasy or substances instead of facing reality. You''re not aggressive overtly.$$, $$You''re not naturally passionate but spiritually connected sexually. You''re drawn to rescue fantasy. You merge too completely with partners. You can''t set boundaries. You''re passive and let partners dominate. You''re creative and romantic.$$, $$Your passive nature lets you be victimized. Your rescue fantasies lead to codependency. You escape conflict instead of facing it. Your lack of boundaries means you absorb partners'' aggression. Your compassion becomes self-sacrifice.$$, $$Set firm boundaries. Face conflict directly. Distinguish between helping and rescuing. Understand that taking care of yourself isn''t selfish. Your compassion is powerful when also boundaried. Your creativity is attractive when also grounded.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

-- JUPITER IN SIGNS
('Jupiter', 'Aries', $$Your luck and growth come through bold action and faith in yourself. You''re naturally confident and expand through taking risks. You''re blessed with initiative and courage. Your challenge is overconfidence.$$, $$You''re optimistic and believe you can do anything. You jump into new ventures with enthusiasm. You''re not afraid of failure. People believe in you because you believe in yourself. You''re generous with energy and encouragement. You start many things.$$, $$You''re fun and engaging in relationships. You''re confident and your confidence is attractive. You take risks with your heart. You can be reckless with people''s feelings. You''re not jealous or possessive. You''re generous with time and attention.$$, $$Your overconfidence blinds you to real problems. You''re reckless and hurt people. You take on too much and fail. Your enthusiasm is exhausting. Your generosity lacks follow-through. You''re selfish beneath the charm.$$, $$Check your assumptions against reality. Finish what you start before starting more. Understand that confidence without competence is dangerous. Your faith is powerful when also grounded. Your generosity is real when also consistent.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Jupiter', 'Taurus', $$Your luck and growth come through stability and material development. You''re naturally abundant and attract resources. You''re blessed with steady growth and comfort. Your challenge is attachment to possessions.$$, $$You attract money and resources naturally. You''re comfortable and enjoy the finer things. You grow steadily and reliably. You''re not flashy but solid. You''re generous with those you love. You accumulate wealth over time.$$, $$You''re generous and create comfort for partners. You''re sensual and enjoy physical pleasure. You''re stable and reliable. You''re loyal and committed. You''re not dramatic or needy. You show love through material provision.$$, $$Your attachment to wealth is obsessive. You measure worth by money. Your generosity is conditional on loyalty. You''re so focused on accumulation you miss life. Your stability becomes stagnation. You can''t let go of anything.$$, $$Practice generosity without keeping score. Distinguish between security and obsession. Let go of things sometimes. Understand that true wealth includes people and experiences. Your abundance is powerful when also shared. Your stability is beautiful when also flexible.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Jupiter', 'Gemini', $$Your luck and growth come through learning and communication. You''re naturally curious and expand through knowledge. You''re blessed with wit and adaptability. Your challenge is spreading yourself too thin.$$, $$You''re interested in everything and learn quickly. You''re great at languages and communication. You know someone in every field. You make connections others miss. You''re optimistic about possibilities. You talk your way into opportunities.$$, $$You''re engaging and fun conversationally. You''re interested in your partners'' thoughts and ideas. You can seem shallow because you skim surfaces. You need intellectual stimulation. You''re loyal but not intensely so. You''re charming and adaptable.$$, $$Your scattered energy means you master nothing. You know a lot about everything and nothing deeply. Your talkativeness exhausts people. You spread yourself and others too thin. Your optimism masks real problems. You''re unreliable because you''re juggling too much.$$, $$Choose depth in a few areas. Complete projects before starting new ones. Listen more than you talk. Understand that mastery matters. Your curiosity is powerful when also focused. Your wit is attractive when also substantial.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Jupiter', 'Cancer', $$Your luck and growth come through nurturing and family. You''re naturally caring and expand through connection. You''re blessed with emotional security and belonging. Your challenge is clinginess and over-protection.$$, $$You''re the keeper of family traditions and stories. People feel safe with you. You''re generous with time and care. You create warm, welcoming spaces. You attract people who need nurturing. Your home is your kingdom.$$, $$You''re devoted in relationships and create safety. You''re empathic and nurturing. You''re loyal and committed. You''re protective of partners. You can be clingy and overly focused on others'' needs. You''re not easily hurt because family bonds are everything.$$, $$Your clinginess is suffocating and controlling. Your protection is smothering. You use guilt and withdrawal to keep people close. Your family focus excludes everyone else. You''re codependent. You lose yourself in relationships.$$, $$Set emotional boundaries with family. Distinguish between nurturing and controlling. Encourage independence in those you love. Understand that growth sometimes means separation. Your nurturing is powerful when also boundaried. Your care is beautiful when also respectful.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Jupiter', 'Leo', $$Your luck and growth come through creative self-expression and generosity. You''re naturally magnetic and expand through sharing your gifts. You''re blessed with warmth and charisma. Your challenge is self-centeredness and needing validation.$$, $$You''re the natural leader and people are drawn to you. You''re generous and want the best for others. You''re creative and inspire people. You have faith in yourself and others. You''re naturally likeable. You attract opportunities and abundance.$$, $$You''re warm and generous in relationships. You''re romantic and passionate. You''re loyal and devoted. You can be self-centered and need constant admiration. You''re playful and fun. You''re attracted to beauty and elegance.$$, $$Your need for validation is narcissistic and exhausting. You''re so focused on yourself you miss partners'' needs. You''re possessive and jealous when not the center. Your generosity comes with strings. Your charm masks selfishness.$$, $$Practice doing things for your own joy, not recognition. Appreciate partners'' quiet support. Focus on partners'' needs as much as your own. Understand that real greatness is humble. Your warmth is powerful when not contingent on adoration. Your generosity is genuine when unconditional.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Jupiter', 'Virgo', $$Your luck and growth come through service and discernment. You''re naturally helpful and expand through usefulness. You''re blessed with practical wisdom. Your challenge is perfectionism and self-criticism.$$, $$You''re skilled and competent at what you do. You attract opportunities through your reliability. You''re helpful and people trust you. You''re health-conscious and disciplined. You improve systems and situations. Your work is your gift.$$, $$You''re reliable and helpful in relationships. You show love through service and practical care. You''re healthy and fit. You''re loyal and committed. You can be critical and make partners feel inadequate. You''re humble about your abilities.$$, $$Your perfectionism is paralyzing for you and others. You''re so critical that nothing is good enough. You shame yourself and others for flaws. Your helpfulness is exhausting because it comes with judgment. You burnout from unrealistic standards.$$, $$Praise what''s working alongside critiques. Accept "good enough." Be kind to yourself and others about imperfection. Understand that your service is a gift, not an obligation. Your discernment is powerful when paired with compassion. Your competence is attractive when also accepting.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Jupiter', 'Libra', $$Your luck and growth come through relationships and beauty. You''re naturally diplomatic and expand through partnership. You''re blessed with grace and fairness. Your challenge is indecision and people-pleasing.$$, $$You attract good relationships and friendships naturally. You''re graceful and put people at ease. You''re fair-minded and fight for justice. You have good taste and are drawn to beauty. You attract partners easily. You''re blessed in love.$$, $$You''re charming and attractive to partners. You''re romantic and believe in love. You''re diplomatic and smooth in conflict. You can seem indecisive and wishy-washy. You adapt to partners and lose yourself. You need reassurance constantly.$$, $$Your indecision is paralyzing and frustrating. You people-please until you resent partners. You stay in bad relationships to avoid being alone. Your charm masks avoidance. You have no real opinions of your own.$$, $$Make decisions independently. Express your real opinions gently but clearly. Choose yourself sometimes. Understand that boundaries create real relationship. Your diplomacy is powerful when you also know what you stand for. Your charm is beautiful when also authentic.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Jupiter', 'Scorpio', $$Your luck and growth come through depth and transformation. You''re naturally perceptive and expand through facing the shadows. You''re blessed with insight and power. Your challenge is obsession and control.$$, $$You''re magnetic and people are drawn to your intensity. You''re perceptive and see what others miss. You''re relentless in pursuit of truth. You''re not afraid of the dark or taboo. You attract power and resources. You''re blessed with luck in money matters.$$, $$You''re intensely sexual and magnetic. You''re perceptive about partners. You''re loyal and devoted once committed. You can be controlling and manipulative. You''re obsessive and jealous. You''re all-in or completely out.$$, $$Your obsession is suffocating and controlling. You''re manipulative and use what you know against people. Your intensity is overwhelming. Your jealousy poisons relationships. You destroy everything you touch when not careful.$$, $$Practice trust and transparency. Share your vulnerabilities. Use your power to help, not control. Understand that real transformation requires releasing control. Your intensity is powerful when also honest. Your depth is beautiful when you''re also open.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Jupiter', 'Sagittarius', $$Your luck and growth come through exploration and learning. You''re naturally optimistic and expand through adventures. You''re blessed with faith and possibility. Your challenge is recklessness and lack of follow-through.$$, $$You''re naturally lucky and things work out for you. You''re optimistic and believe in growth. You''re drawn to travel, learning, and new experiences. You''re generous and inspire others. You have faith in the future. Opportunities come easily.$$, $$You''re playful and fun in relationships. You give partners freedom and don''t cage them. You''re optimistic and uplifting. You''re unfaithful because you need new experiences. You''re not great with commitment. You''re charming and engaging.$$, $$Your recklessness burns bridges and hurts people. Your need for novelty makes you irresponsible in relationships. Your optimism masks real problems and avoids consequences. You''re unreliable and skip town. Your generosity is empty because you don''t follow through.$$, $$Think about consequences before acting. Stay with one person through difficulty. Finish what you start before seeking adventure. Understand that real freedom includes chosen commitment. Your optimism is powerful when also grounded. Your adventurousness is attractive when also responsible.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Jupiter', 'Capricorn', $$Your luck and growth come through achievement and structure. You''re naturally disciplined and expand through mastery. You''re blessed with long-term success. Your challenge is joylessness and overwork.$$, $$You''re ambitious and work systematically toward goals. You''re disciplined and don''t get distracted. You''re respected for your competence. You attract success and status. You''re blessed with abundance through hard work. You''re natural leaders.$$, $$You''re reliable and committed in relationships. You show love through provision and commitment. You''re serious and formal. You can seem cold emotionally. You''re not naturally playful or spontaneous. You''re loyal but reserved.$$, $$Your drive for success is joyless and isolating. You work so much you forget why you wanted success. You''re so controlled you can''t relax or connect. You''re depressive and cynical. Your relationships suffer because they''re lower priority.$$, $$Celebrate wins and take time to enjoy them. Make time for play and pleasure regularly. Connect with people, not just tasks. Understand that success without joy is empty. Your ambition is powerful when also warm. Your achievement is meaningful when shared.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Jupiter', 'Aquarius', $$Your luck and growth come through innovation and idealism. You''re naturally visionary and expand through unconventional thinking. You''re blessed with insight about the future. Your challenge is detachment and unworldliness.$$, $$You''re interested in big ideas and future possibilities. You''re naturally lucky with group endeavors and tech. You''re idealistic and want to change the world. You attract friends and community. You''re blessed with unique perspectives. You''re ahead of your time.$$, $$You''re friendly but emotionally distant in relationships. You''re interested in partners'' minds. You value freedom and independence. You''re idealistic about love. You can seem cold and unavailable. You need intellectual compatibility.$$, $$Your detachment is isolating and lonely. Your idealism makes you reject real people and relationships. Your unworldliness leaves you helpless in practical matters. You''re so focused on the future you miss the present. You''re emotionally unavailable.$$, $$Connect emotionally, not just intellectually. Allow yourself to need and be needed. Understand that real change happens in present relationships. Your vision is powerful when also grounded. Your idealism is beautiful when also compassionate.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Jupiter', 'Pisces', $$Your luck and growth come through compassion and spirituality. You''re naturally empathic and expand through faith. You''re blessed with intuition and connection. Your challenge is escapism and loss of boundaries.$$, $$You''re compassionate and people feel understood by you. You''re intuitive and have good instincts. You''re generous and want to help everyone. You''re artistic and creative. You''re spiritual and seeking meaning. You''re blessed with faith and connection.$$, $$You''re romantic and believe in soulmates. You''re empathic and intuitively understand partners. You''re creative and spiritual. You''re devoted and merge with partners. You can lose yourself in relationships. You''re idealistic and disappointed when partners are human.$$, $$Your lack of boundaries means you absorb everyone''s pain. You escape into fantasy or substances to avoid reality. You lose yourself completely in relationships and codependency. Your compassion becomes victimhood and self-sacrifice. You enable others'' dysfunction.$$, $$Set firm emotional boundaries. Spend time alone to distinguish yourself from others. Practice being responsible for your own emotions. Understand that helping requires also helping yourself. Your compassion is powerful when also boundaried. Your faith is beautiful when grounded in reality.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

-- SATURN IN SIGNS
('Saturn', 'Aries', $$Your discipline and growth come through channeling raw drive into focus. You learn caution and timing. Your lessons are about patience and planning before action. Authority figures teach you to think before you speak.$$, $$You''re frustrated by your own hesitation. You want to act but something holds you back. You learn to choose battles carefully. You''re disciplined and can focus intensely. You''re delayed in starting things, then they succeed. Your learning curve is steep.$$, $$You''re cautious in relationships and afraid of being hurt. You hold back affection until you''re sure. You''re loyal but reserved. You learn about real commitment through difficulty. You struggle to express anger and need to learn assertiveness. Your relationships mature slowly but deeply.$$, $$Your caution becomes paralysis and you never start. You''re so afraid you miss opportunities. Your discipline becomes rigidity and you burn out. Your hesitation is mistaken for coldness. You miss the spontaneity of life.$$, $$Take calculated risks despite fear. Start before you''re ready. Understand that imperfection is the price of living. Your caution is powerful when also courageous. Your focus is beautiful when also playful.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Saturn', 'Taurus', $$Your discipline and growth come through building real, lasting security. You learn the value of work and patience. Your lessons are about holding steady through difficulty. You earn what you have.$$, $$You work relentlessly to build security. You''re delayed in material success but it lasts. You learn to let go of what you can''t control. You''re naturally disciplined and reliable. You''re frustrated by your slow progress sometimes. Your foundation is solid.$$, $$You''re slow to commit but loyal for life. You''re cautious about money and relationships. You learn about real love through sustained effort. You struggle with jealousy and possessiveness. You''re reliable and constant. Your relationships deepen over time.$$, $$Your attachment to security is obsessive and keeps you stuck. You can''t let go even when you should. Your caution becomes paranoia about loss. Your stubbornness makes you refuse change. You isolate yourself for false security.$$, $$Practice letting go and trusting. Distinguish between security and stagnation. Take risks despite fear of loss. Understand that growth sometimes requires letting go. Your stability is powerful when also flexible. Your discipline is beautiful when also generous.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Saturn', 'Gemini', $$Your discipline and growth come through focusing your restless mind. You learn depth over breadth. Your lessons are about commitment and follow-through. You master one thing at a time.$$, $$You''re frustrated by your scattered thoughts. You need structure for your ideas. You learn through focused study and writing. You''re disciplined communicator when you choose. You''re delayed in mastery but earn it. Your learning is thorough.$$, $$You''re cautious in communication and think before speaking. You need time to warm up to partners. You''re good listener when focused. You can seem withdrawn or cold. You''re loyal but not demonstrative. Your relationships deepen when you open up.$$, $$Your overthinking paralyzes you. You''re so focused on perfect words you don''t communicate. Your caution becomes silence. Your fear of saying wrong thing keeps you from saying anything. You isolate through miscommunication.$$, $$Speak imperfectly and communicate anyway. Finish one thing before starting another. Trust your words enough to share them. Understand that communication is messy and that''s okay. Your thoughtfulness is powerful when also expressed. Your depth is beautiful when shared.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Saturn', 'Cancer', $$Your discipline and growth come through managing emotional depth. You learn emotional control and resilience. Your lessons are about security that''s built from within. Family wounds teach you to build true safety.$$, $$You''re cautious with feelings and restrained emotionally. You struggled with family or emotional insecurity. You learn to self-soothe and be emotionally independent. You''re disciplined about your home and domestic life. Your emotions strengthen over time.$$, $$You''re slow to open emotionally in relationships. You''re afraid of being hurt or abandoned. You learn to trust slowly and deeply. You''re loyal and committed once bonded. You struggle with neediness—either yours or partners''. Your love is deep and responsible.$$, $$Your emotional walls are impenetrable. You can''t connect even when you want to. Your caution makes you miss relationships. Your fear of abandonment creates it through isolation. You''re depressive and isolated.$$, $$Allow yourself to feel despite fear. Open your heart gradually to safe people. Understand that vulnerability is strength. Your emotional control is powerful when also felt. Your depth is beautiful when shared.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Saturn', 'Leo', $$Your discipline and growth come through learning true humility. You learn to express yourself without needing validation. Your lessons are about authentic creativity, not performance. You earn recognition through real work.$$, $$You''re frustrated by your need for recognition. You work hard to gain attention but it comes slowly. You learn to create for creation''s sake, not applause. You''re dignified and formal. Your confidence grows slowly and becomes real. Your creative work is serious and lasting.$$, $$You''re reserved with affection and afraid of rejection. You need steady reassurance you''re loved. You learn to love without conditions. You struggle with pride and needing to be admired. Your relationships are serious and committed. You''re loyal but can seem cold.$$, $$Your need for validation never gets met. You''re so focused on recognition you miss real connection. Your pride prevents real intimacy. You''re depressive when not the center. Your work lacks joy because you''re always performing for approval.$$, $$Do things for your own joy, not recognition. Let yourself be ordinary sometimes. Practice genuine interest in others'' work alongside yours. Understand that real worth isn''t conditional on validation. Your creativity is powerful when also humble. Your confidence is beautiful when earned through real work.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Saturn', 'Virgo', $$Your discipline and growth come through mastering one skill deeply. You learn the value of precision and service. Your lessons are about being helpful without being controlling. You earn respect through competence.$$, $$You''re naturally disciplined and detail-focused. You''re frustrated by imperfection and slow mastery. You learn through repetition and dedication. You''re skilled and reliable. Your work is thorough and respected. You''re delayed in results but earn lasting success.$$, $$You''re cautious and critical in relationships. You struggle to accept partners'' flaws alongside their strengths. You learn to be helpful without being judgmental. You show love through service but need to show it warmly. Your relationships strengthen through patience.$$, $$Your perfectionism is paralyzing and exhausting. You can''t allow yourself or others to be human. Your service is shaming and controlling. Your criticism damages relationships. You burnout from unrealistic standards.$$, $$Accept "good enough" in yourself and others. Praise alongside critique. Be kind to yourself about imperfection. Understand that your precision is a gift, not a requirement for love. Your competence is powerful when also compassionate. Your service is beautiful when freely given.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Saturn', 'Libra', $$Your discipline and growth come through learning real commitment. You learn to make decisions independently. Your lessons are about genuine partnership, not just peace. You learn to value yourself equally with others.$$, $$You''re frustrated by indecision and fear of choosing. You learn to make hard decisions alone. You''re disciplined about fairness and balance. You struggle with commitment until you understand it''s liberating, not limiting. Your relationships are serious and lasting.$$, $$You''re cautious in relationships and slow to commit. You''re afraid of losing yourself or being controlled. You learn to maintain boundaries in partnerships. You''re serious about love and expect reciprocal effort. You struggle with conflict and avoidance. Your relationships mature beautifully.$$, $$Your fear of commitment keeps you alone. Your indecision is paralyzing. Your people-pleasing makes you resentful. You stay in bad relationships because you can''t choose to leave. Your caution masks low self-worth.$$, $$Make decisions even imperfectly. Choose yourself sometimes. Understand that real partnership requires real self. Your diplomacy is powerful when also decisive. Your fairness is beautiful when also boundaried.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Saturn', 'Scorpio', $$Your discipline and growth come through managing intensity and power. You learn self-mastery and emotional control. Your lessons are about using power responsibly. You earn respect through your depth and integrity.$$, $$You''re naturally disciplined and intense. You learn to channel your power constructively. You''re frustrated by your own darkness and complexity. You become deeply self-aware through difficulty. Your power grows with age. Your work is transformative.$$, $$You''re slow to trust and cautious emotionally. You test partners'' loyalty relentlessly. You learn real intimacy through facing your own shadows. You''re loyal and committed once bonded. You struggle with control and jealousy. Your love is deep and transformative.$$, $$Your caution becomes suspicion and paranoia. You test people until they fail. Your intensity is overwhelming and suffocating. Your power-seeking destroys relationships. Your secretiveness creates the distance you fear.$$, $$Practice transparency and trust. Face your own shadows without projecting them. Use your power to heal, not control. Understand that intimacy requires vulnerability from you. Your intensity is powerful when also open. Your loyalty is beautiful when also trusting.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Saturn', 'Sagittarius', $$Your discipline and growth come through grounding your vision in reality. You learn responsibility and follow-through. Your lessons are about the long view and delayed gratification. You learn wisdom through mistakes.$$, $$You''re frustrated by your own restlessness and need for freedom. You learn to commit to one path. You''re disciplined once you choose direction. Your work is serious and far-reaching. You gain wisdom through hard experience. Your teaching comes from real knowledge.$$, $$You''re cautious about commitment and need freedom. You''re slow to settle and learn about real partnership. You''re honest but learning to be kind alongside honesty. You''re loyal once committed. You struggle with the mundane parts of relationships. Your love deepens with time.$$, $$Your need for freedom keeps you from committing. You run from relationships when they feel limiting. Your optimism masks avoidance of consequences. Your bluntness is cruel. Your adventures are running away.$$, $$Think about consequences before acting. Stay through difficulty instead of seeking exit. Distinguish between honesty and cruelty. Understand that freedom includes chosen commitment. Your vision is powerful when also grounded. Your optimism is beautiful when also responsible.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Saturn', 'Capricorn', $$Your discipline and growth come through building your own empire. You learn mastery and long-term success. Your lessons are about earning respect and real authority. You become the elder you needed.$$, $$You''re naturally disciplined and ambitious. You work relentlessly toward long-term goals. You''re frustrated by slow progress and respect for rules. You learn true success through patience. Your work is serious and lasting. You become respected leader.$$, $$You''re serious about commitment and loyal. You''re cautious about trust and need consistency. You learn to express affection through presence. You''re traditional about relationships. You struggle with warmth and spontaneity. Your love is deep and permanent.$$, $$Your drive for success is joyless and isolating. You work so much relationships suffer. You''re so controlled you can''t relax or connect. Your ambition compensates for emotional emptiness. You''re depressive and cynical.$$, $$Celebrate wins and enjoy achievements. Make time for play and pleasure. Connect with people, not just tasks. Understand that success without joy is empty. Your discipline is powerful when also warm. Your achievement is beautiful when shared.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Saturn', 'Aquarius', $$Your discipline and growth come through grounding your idealism in reality. You learn to build real structures for your vision. Your lessons are about patience with incremental change. You become the visionary leader you needed.$$, $$You''re frustrated by the gap between your vision and reality. You learn to build systems for change. You''re disciplined about your ideals and follow through. Your work is serious and groundbreaking. You gain respect through consistency. Your vision becomes real.$$, $$You''re cautious about emotional intimacy. You''re slow to open and need intellectual connection. You learn that vulnerability with safe people is strength. You''re loyal once committed. You struggle with emotional availability. Your love is deep and committed.$$, $$Your caution becomes emotional unavailability. You can''t connect even when you want to. Your idealism makes you reject real people. Your vision is so future-focused you ignore the present. You''re isolated.$$, $$Connect emotionally to safe people. Allow yourself to need. Understand that your vision is built through real relationships. Your uniqueness is powerful when also grounded. Your idealism is beautiful when also compassionate.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Saturn', 'Pisces', $$Your discipline and growth come through grounding spirituality in reality. You learn to build structure for compassion. Your lessons are about boundaries within service. You become the healer who''s also whole.$$, $$You''re frustrated by the limits of compassion without structure. You learn to set boundaries around your care. You''re disciplined about spiritual practice and service. You''re realistic about suffering without becoming cynical. Your work is healing and grounded. Your wisdom is hard-earned.$$, $$You''re cautious about merging and need safe people to open to. You''re slow to trust and learn discernment. You''re devoted once bonded. You struggle with boundaries and self-sacrifice. Your love is deep and healing. You learn to give without drowning.$$, $$Your lack of boundaries means you absorb others'' pain. You escape into fantasy or substances. Your compassion becomes self-sacrifice. You lose yourself in relationships. You enable others'' dysfunction.$$, $$Set firm boundaries. Spend time alone to distinguish yourself. Practice being responsible for your own emotions. Understand that helping requires boundaries. Your compassion is powerful when also boundaried. Your spirituality is beautiful when also grounded.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

-- URANUS IN SIGNS
('Uranus', 'Aries', $$Your innovation comes through pioneering ideas and disruption. You''re naturally a trailblazer who challenges old ways. You''re wired for rapid change and rebel against constraint. Your electricity is exciting and destabilizing.$$, $$You''re drawn to new and unconventional approaches. You challenge authority and question rules. You''re impatient with tradition. You''re pioneering in your field or relationships. You''re magnetic and people are drawn to you. You shock people regularly.$$, $$You''re attracted to unconventional people and relationships. You rebel against traditional coupling. You need freedom and don''t like jealousy or possession. You''re exciting and unpredictable. You can be reckless and emotionally distant. You challenge partners.$$, $$Your need to rebel undermines stability. You shock people unnecessarily and hurt them. You can''t commit because commitment feels like death. Your freedom is running away. You''re self-destructive.$$, $$Channel your pioneering energy into building something new. Rebel against what''s truly limiting, not what''s healthy. Understand that chosen commitment is freedom, not constraint. Your innovation is powerful when constructive. Your uniqueness is beautiful when grounded.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Uranus', 'Taurus', $$Your innovation comes through disrupting material systems and values. You''re wired to challenge fixed beliefs about worth and resources. You revolutionize stability in slow, lasting ways. Your changes are structural and real.$$, $$You''re drawn to disrupting material and social systems. You challenge conventional views about money and possessions. You''re interested in new economic models. You''re slow-burning revolutionary. Your changes are lasting. You shock people about their attachments.$$, $$You''re attracted to unconventional people and relationships. You rebel against traditional partnership structures. You don''t follow relationship rules. You need freedom within commitment. You''re loyal but unpredictable. You challenge partners'' assumptions.$$, $$Your rebellion against stability is destructive. You destroy what you build because revolution is constant. You can''t create lasting things because change is your only value. You hurt people through constant disruption. Your freedom undermines security.$$, $$Channel your innovation into building new structures that last. Create sustainable change. Understand that some stability allows freedom. Your revolution is powerful when also constructive. Your uniqueness is beautiful when also grounded.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Uranus', 'Gemini', $$Your innovation comes through disrupting communication and thinking. You''re naturally wired to challenge conventional ideas. You see unexpected connections others miss. Your brilliance is fast and electric.$$, $$You''re drawn to radical ideas and unconventional thinking. You challenge assumptions constantly. You''re interested in technology and futuristic concepts. You''re witty and your humor is edgy. You shock people with your statements. You''re ahead of the curve.$$, $$You''re intellectually stimulating and unconventional. You challenge partners'' thinking. You''re attracted to brilliant, unusual people. You need freedom and intellectual space. You can be emotionally cold. You rebel against traditional partnership. You''re unpredictable.$$, $$Your constant questioning becomes paralysis. Your need to be different makes you reject anything conventional. You''re cold and detached from feelings. Your communication is shocking but not constructive. You isolate people with your difference.$$, $$Channel your ideas into building new ways of thinking. Question constructively, not just for rebellion. Allow emotion alongside intellect. Understand that some traditions exist for good reasons. Your brilliance is powerful when also grounded. Your uniqueness is beautiful when also connected.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Uranus', 'Cancer', $$Your innovation comes through disrupting family structures and emotional traditions. You''re wired to challenge conventional relationships. You revolutionize how people understand belonging. Your changes are deeply personal.$$, $$You''re drawn to unconventional family structures and ways of living. You challenge traditional notions of home and family. You rebel against emotional manipulation and codependency. You''re interested in alternative communities. You shock people about what family means.$$, $$You''re attracted to unconventional emotional connections. You rebel against traditional partnership and roles. You need freedom within relationships. You''re emotionally unpredictable and cool when others expect warmth. You''re loyal but surprising. You challenge partners'' assumptions.$$, $$Your rebellion against emotional closeness keeps people away. You reject genuine connection because it feels traditional. You can''t build lasting emotional security. Your independence keeps you isolated. Your shock value damages relationships.$$, $$Allow yourself to build emotional security. Distinguish between liberation and abandonment. Value genuine connection alongside independence. Understand that some traditions serve people well. Your revolution is powerful when also building. Your uniqueness is beautiful when also bonded.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Uranus', 'Leo', $$Your innovation comes through disrupting creative self-expression and power structures. You''re naturally wired to challenge authority and status. You revolutionize how people understand performance and authenticity. Your vision is radical and creative.$$, $$You''re drawn to unconventional creativity and self-expression. You challenge traditional notions of art and performance. You rebel against hierarchy and status. You''re interested in democratizing power. You shock people with your vision. You''re a revolutionary artist.$$, $$You''re attracted to unconventional people and creative partners. You rebel against traditional romance. You need freedom and hate possession. You''re exciting and unpredictable. You''re loyal but cool. You challenge partners'' assumptions about love.$$, $$Your need to be different makes you alienate people. Your shock value damages relationships. You rebel against authentic connection because it feels traditional. Your independence keeps you isolated. Your unconventionality is self-destructive.$$, $$Channel your radical creativity into real work. Create for creation''s sake, not to shock. Allow genuine connection alongside freedom. Understand that authentic expression sometimes feels conventional. Your vision is powerful when constructive. Your uniqueness is beautiful when also connected.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Uranus', 'Virgo', $$Your innovation comes through disrupting work systems and service structures. You''re naturally wired to revolutionize how things function. You see new ways to organize and improve. Your changes are practical and efficient.$$, $$You''re drawn to disrupting work systems and traditional methods. You challenge conventional approaches to organization. You''re interested in technology and efficiency innovations. You rebel against hierarchy in work. You shock people with your new approaches. You''re a systems revolutionary.$$, $$You''re attracted to unconventional people intellectually. You rebel against traditional partnership roles. You need freedom and independence. You''re unpredictable in routine. You can seem cold because you''re in your head. You''re loyal but distant. You challenge partners about efficiency.$$, $$Your constant need to improve becomes obsessive. Your revolution destroys what works. Your independence makes you emotionally unavailable. You shock people unnecessarily. Your need for change undermines stability.$$, $$Channel your innovation into building better systems. Know when something works and stop improving. Allow emotion alongside efficiency. Understand that good enough is sometimes enough. Your brilliance is powerful when also grounded. Your improvement is beautiful when also compassionate.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Uranus', 'Libra', $$Your innovation comes through disrupting relationships and social contracts. You''re naturally wired to question partnership norms. You revolutionize how people understand connection. Your vision for relationships is radical and fair.$$, $$You''re drawn to disrupting relationship traditions. You challenge conventional partnership structures. You rebel against traditional roles and expectations. You''re interested in new relationship models. You shock people about what partnership can be.$$, $$You''re attracted to unconventional people and partnerships. You rebel against traditional coupling. You need radical freedom and equality. You''re exciting and unpredictable. You''re loyal but cool. You challenge partners'' assumptions about love.$$, $$Your need for revolution keeps you from committing. You reject every partnership because they all feel traditional. Your independence isolates you. Your shock value damages relationships. Your freedom means no one gets close.$$, $$Allow yourself to build genuine partnership within freedom. Distinguish between healthy commitment and constraint. Value connection alongside independence. Understand that some traditions exist to honor real intimacy. Your vision is powerful when constructive. Your uniqueness is beautiful when also bonded.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Uranus', 'Scorpio', $$Your innovation comes through disrupting power dynamics and revealing hidden truths. You''re naturally wired to shake up secret systems. You revolutionize how people understand power and transformation. Your vision is explosive and profound.$$, $$You''re drawn to exposing hidden truths and disrupting power structures. You challenge traditional power dynamics. You rebel against manipulation and control. You''re interested in radical transformation. You shock people about what''s been hidden. You''re a revolutionary.$$, $$You''re attracted to intense, unconventional people. You rebel against possessive relationships. You need freedom and transparency. You''re magnetic but unpredictable. You challenge partners'' control issues. You''re loyal but surprising. You transform relationships.$$, $$Your need to expose and disrupt destroys intimacy. You shock people unnecessarily and harm them. You can''t commit because commitment feels controlling. Your freedom is running away. Your need for revolution isolates you.$$, $$Channel your insight into helping transformation, not just disrupting. Know what needs changing and what can stay. Allow trust alongside independence. Understand that some closeness isn''t control. Your intensity is powerful when constructive. Your depth is beautiful when also trustworthy.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Uranus', 'Sagittarius', $$Your innovation comes through disrupting belief systems and expanding horizons. You''re naturally wired to question every philosophy. You revolutionize how people understand truth and growth. Your vision is progressive and bold.$$, $$You''re drawn to disrupting traditional beliefs and values. You challenge conventional wisdom constantly. You rebel against dogma. You''re interested in radical new philosophies. You shock people about what''s possible. You''re pioneering a new way forward.$$, $$You''re attracted to unconventional people and ideas. You rebel against traditional partnership. You need radical freedom. You''re exciting and adventurous. You''re unfaithful because commitment feels limiting. You shock partners. You''re honest but harsh.$$, $$Your need to rebel keeps you from committing. Your constant questioning becomes cynicism. Your honesty becomes cruelty. Your freedom means you skip town before anything deepens. Your innovation is destruction.$$, $$Channel your vision into building new belief systems. Question wisely, not just for rebellion. Distinguish between honesty and harm. Understand that some traditions have wisdom. Your pioneering spirit is powerful when grounded. Your expansion is beautiful when also committed.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Uranus', 'Capricorn', $$Your innovation comes through disrupting established systems and power structures. You''re naturally wired to revolutionize how society works. You challenge authority in lasting ways. Your changes are structural and transformative.$$, $$You''re drawn to disrupting institutions and traditional structures. You challenge authority and hierarchy. You rebel against outdated systems. You''re interested in structural change. You shock people about how things work. You''re a revolutionary organizer.$$, $$You''re attracted to unconventional people with power and vision. You rebel against traditional partnership. You need freedom and equality. You''re cool and unpredictable. You''re loyal but surprising. You challenge partners'' assumptions about power.$$, $$Your need for revolution undermines stability. You destroy what others build because it feels old. You can''t commit because commitment feels like death. Your independence isolates you. Your shock value is destructive.$$, $$Channel your vision into building new structures that work. Create systems that serve people. Know when something is working and protect it. Understand that some traditions are wise. Your revolutionary vision is powerful when constructive. Your uniqueness is beautiful when also grounded.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Uranus', 'Aquarius', $$Your innovation comes through technological and ideological revolution. You''re naturally wired to see the future. You''re ahead of your time and others struggle to understand. Your vision is brilliant and far-reaching.$$, $$You''re drawn to technology and futuristic ideas. You challenge conventional thinking. You rebel against limited possibilities. You''re interested in radical new futures. You shock people with your vision. You''re pioneering what''s next.$$, $$You''re attracted to unconventional, brilliant people. You rebel against traditional partnership. You need radical freedom and independence. You''re cool and unpredictable. You''re loyal but distant. You challenge partners'' emotional expectations.$$, $$Your need for independence keeps you isolated. Your vision is so future-focused you ignore the present. You can''t connect emotionally even when you want to. Your freedom means no one gets close. Your shock value alienates people.$$, $$Bring your vision into the present. Allow emotional connection alongside independence. Value people alongside ideas. Understand that real revolution is built with people. Your brilliance is powerful when grounded. Your vision is beautiful when compassionate.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Uranus', 'Pisces', $$Your innovation comes through disrupting spiritual beliefs and dissolving boundaries. You''re naturally wired to imagine new spiritual paradigms. You challenge conventional spirituality radically. Your vision is mystical and boundary-breaking.$$, $$You''re drawn to disrupting spiritual dogma. You challenge conventional spirituality. You rebel against closed belief systems. You''re interested in mystical innovations. You shock people about reality and consciousness. You''re a spiritual revolutionary.$$, $$You''re attracted to unconventional, spiritual people. You rebel against traditional partnership. You need radical freedom and boundary-dissolution. You''re cool and unpredictable. You''re idealistic about love. You challenge partners'' assumptions about reality.$$, $$Your boundary dissolution makes you absorb everyone''s chaos. Your need for freedom keeps you from committing. You escape into fantasy about new realities. Your shock value damages relationships. Your independence isolates you.$$, $$Set boundaries while remaining open. Ground your spirituality in reality. Allow genuine connection alongside freedom. Understand that some boundaries protect healthy intimacy. Your vision is powerful when grounded. Your compassion is beautiful when boundaried.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

