('Neptune', 'Aries', $$Your imagination comes through spiritual warrior energy. You dream of heroic quests and noble causes. Your inspiration is idealistic and activating. Your fantasy can drive you to real action.$$, $$You''re drawn to noble causes and spiritual battles. Your imagination fuels your actions. You see beauty in courage and sacrifice. You can be delusional about your abilities. You inspire people with your vision. Your faith moves mountains.$$, $$You''re attracted to romantic, spiritual partners. You idealize them initially. You project heroism onto them. You can be reckless sexually in pursuit of your fantasy. Your passion is spiritual and intense. You''re naive about love.$$, $$Your idealism about causes makes you self-destructive. Your fantasy makes you reckless. Your spiritual warrior energy leads you to unnecessary battles. Your naivety hurts you. Your inspiration is disconnected from reality.$$, $$Dream big but check your plans against reality. Distinguish between worthy cause and destructive obsession. Notice when fantasy is driving decisions. Understand that spiritual growth includes groundedness. Your inspiration is powerful when realistic. Your heroism is beautiful when also wise.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Neptune', 'Taurus', $$Your imagination comes through sensual, artistic dreams. You fantasize about beautiful, comfortable lives. Your inspiration is aesthetic and earthy. Your creativity is grounded in senses.$$, $$You''re drawn to beauty and comfortable living. Your imagination is sensual and material. You dream of security and pleasure. You can be delusional about what you can accumulate. Your art is touched by magic. Your vision is luxurious.$$, $$You''re attracted to comfortable, sensual partners. You idealize them and their lifestyle. You project stability onto them. You''re sexually dreamy and sensual. Your love is merged with their image. You''re vague about practical commitment.$$, $$Your fantasy about material security is unrealistic. Your idealism about lifestyle leaves you poor. Your escape into comfort-fantasy prevents real work. Your vagueness about money causes problems. Your romanticism about love makes you blind.$$, $$Dream about comfort but work toward it realistically. Distinguish between fantasy and actionable goals. Ground your art in practice and discipline. Understand that real security comes from work. Your sensuality is powerful when grounded. Your dreams are beautiful when also real.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Neptune', 'Gemini', $$Your imagination comes through words and ideas. You dream of perfect communication and infinite knowledge. Your inspiration is verbal and intellectual. Your creativity flows through language.$$, $$You''re drawn to ideas and words. Your imagination expands through thinking and talking. You fantasize about knowledge and perfect understanding. You can be vague and unclear despite loving words. Your communication is poetic. Your thinking is imaginative.$$, $$You''re attracted to brilliant, talkative partners. You idealize their minds. You merge intellectually with them. You can be inconsistent in communication. Your words are dreamy but unclear. You''re romantically interested but vague about commitment.$$, $$Your intellectual fantasy prevents real depth. Your love of words masks actual communication gaps. You talk about connection instead of creating it. Your vagueness is exhausting. Your idealism about perfect understanding is delusional.$$, $$Communicate clearly, not just poetically. Say what you mean directly. Distinguish between fantasy and fact. Ground your ideas in reality. Understand that love requires clear words. Your imagination is powerful when also clear. Your inspiration is beautiful when understandable.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Neptune', 'Cancer', $$Your imagination comes through emotional and family dreams. You fantasize about perfect belonging and unconditional love. Your inspiration is deeply emotional. Your creativity flows through feelings.$$, $$You''re drawn to family and emotional connection. Your imagination is emotional and nurturing. You dream of perfect safety and belonging. You can be delusional about relationships. Your art is touching and emotional. Your empathy is profound.$$, $$You''re attracted to partners who need nurturing. You idealize them as your soulmate. You merge emotionally completely. You can be emotionally enmeshed and unclear about boundaries. Your love is spiritual and merged. You''re blind to red flags.$$, $$Your fantasy about perfect family is delusional. Your merger keeps you from real intimacy. Your emotional idealization is codependency. Your blindness to problems enables dysfunction. Your compassion becomes self-sacrifice.$$, $$Set emotional boundaries. Distinguish between your feelings and partners''. Face reality of relationships not fantasy. Understand that love requires clear seeing. Your empathy is powerful when boundaried. Your nurturing is beautiful when also self-preserving.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Neptune', 'Leo', $$Your imagination comes through creative and spiritual inspiration. You dream of glory and transcendent self-expression. Your inspiration is romantic and theatrical. Your creativity flows through performance.$$, $$You''re drawn to creative expression and spirituality. Your imagination is romantic and grand. You dream of artistic recognition and spiritual awakening. You can be delusional about your talent. Your art is inspired and moving. Your vision is theatrical.$$, $$You''re attracted to romantic, artistic partners. You idealize them as your soulmate. You merge creatively and spiritually with them. You can be blind to practical reality. Your love is spiritual and grand. You''re idealistic about partnership.$$, $$Your fantasy about artistic recognition is unrealistic. Your idealism makes you blind to partners'' flaws. Your need for merger stifles creativity. Your romanticism prevents practical partnership. Your spiritual idealism is escapism.$$, $$Dream about creativity but work toward it disciplined. See partners clearly, not as projections. Distinguish between spiritual connection and merger. Ground your vision in practice. Understand that real art requires work. Your inspiration is powerful when also disciplined. Your romance is beautiful when also realistic.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Neptune', 'Virgo', $$Your imagination comes through service dreams and healing visions. You fantasize about perfect healing and order. Your inspiration is transcendent and practical. Your creativity flows through service.$$, $$You''re drawn to healing and service work. Your imagination helps others. You dream of perfect health and organization. You can be vague about practical details. Your work is inspired and healing. Your vision improves systems.$$, $$You''re attracted to partners you can heal or serve. You idealize them as needing you. You merge through caregiving. You can be unclear about healthy boundaries. Your love is service-oriented and spiritual. You''re blind to enablement.$$, $$Your fantasy about perfect health is unrealistic. Your rescue fantasies create codependency. Your service becomes self-sacrifice. Your vagueness about boundaries enables others. Your perfectionism is impossible.$$, $$Help without rescuing. See people clearly, not as projects. Set firm boundaries in care work. Distinguish between service and self-sacrifice. Ground your visions in reality. Understand that healing requires boundaries. Your compassion is powerful when boundaried. Your service is beautiful when also balanced.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Neptune', 'Libra', $$Your imagination comes through relationship and beauty dreams. You fantasize about perfect partnership and harmony. Your inspiration is romantic and aesthetic. Your creativity flows through connection.$$, $$You''re drawn to beautiful relationships and artistic partnership. Your imagination is romantic. You dream of perfect balance and soulmate connection. You can be vague about real conflict. Your vision is beautiful and harmonious. Your creativity flows through collaboration.$$, $$You''re attracted to beautiful, harmonious partners. You idealize them as perfect soulmate. You merge completely in relationship. You can be unclear about your own needs. Your love is romantic and spiritual. You''re blind to partners'' flaws.$$, $$Your fantasy about perfect partnership is delusional. Your idealization prevents real connection. Your merger keeps you from self-knowledge. Your vagueness enables bad partnerships. Your romanticism prevents honest communication.$$, $$See partners clearly, not as projections. Maintain your own identity in partnership. Communicate clearly about conflict. Distinguish between idealized love and real love. Ground your vision in reality. Understand that partnership requires honesty. Your romanticism is powerful when real. Your harmony is beautiful when also authentic.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Neptune', 'Scorpio', $$Your imagination comes through depth and transformation dreams. You fantasize about profound union and mysterious truth. Your inspiration is occult and transformative. Your creativity flows through shadows.$$, $$You''re drawn to mysteries and deep truths. Your imagination explores hidden realities. You dream of profound transformation and merged consciousness. You can be delusional about power and knowledge. Your work is transformative and mysterious. Your vision penetrates the shadows.$$, $$You''re attracted to mysterious, intense partners. You idealize them as spiritually matched. You merge psychically and spiritually. You can be controlling in your idealization. Your love is intense and merged. You''re blind to manipulation.$$, $$Your fantasy about merged consciousness is delusional. Your idealization is controlling and obsessive. Your secrecy enables dysfunction. Your depth becomes darkness. Your imagination leads to paranoia.$$, $$See reality clearly despite the mystery. Maintain your own consciousness in relationship. Set boundaries around merging. Distinguish between wisdom and delusion. Ground your spiritual vision in ethics. Understand that real transformation requires honesty. Your depth is powerful when also clear. Your intensity is beautiful when also honest.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Neptune', 'Sagittarius', $$Your imagination comes through spiritual quests and philosophical dreams. You fantasize about enlightenment and higher truth. Your inspiration is mystical and expansive. Your creativity flows through teaching and vision.$$, $$You''re drawn to spiritual seeking and philosophical exploration. Your imagination is expansive. You dream of enlightenment and universal truth. You can be delusional about your understanding. Your teaching is inspired and visionary. Your faith is boundless.$$, $$You''re attracted to spiritual, adventurous partners. You idealize them as enlightened. You merge spiritually with them. You can be vague about practical commitment. Your love is spiritual and grand. You''re blind to actual dysfunction.$$, $$Your spiritual fantasy prevents real work. Your idealism about enlightenment is escapism. Your vagueness about commitment creates pain. Your expansion masks avoidance. Your faith is blind.$$, $$Ground your spirituality in practice and ethics. Commit to real work, not just ideas. See partners clearly, not idealized. Distinguish between inspiration and delusion. Understand that enlightenment includes showing up. Your wisdom is powerful when grounded. Your vision is beautiful when also practical.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Neptune', 'Capricorn', $$Your imagination comes through material and career visions. You fantasize about meaningful achievement and transcendent success. Your inspiration is practical and ambitious. Your creativity flows through work.$$, $$You''re drawn to meaningful work and achievement. Your imagination elevates practical goals. You dream of success with purpose and spiritual meaning. You can be delusional about your influence. Your work is inspired and substantial. Your vision transforms structures.$$, $$You''re attracted to ambitious, successful partners. You idealize them as enlightened. You merge through shared vision. You can be vague about emotional connection. Your love is purposeful and merged. You''re blind to emotional neglect.$$, $$Your fantasy about success as salvation is delusional. Your ambition masks spiritual emptiness. Your vagueness about emotions creates distance. Your work becomes your escape. Your vision disconnects you from people.$$, $$Ground your ambitions in real values. Connect emotionally with people, not just projects. See partners clearly beyond achievement. Distinguish between success and meaning. Understand that transcendence includes human connection. Your ambition is powerful when also warm. Your vision is beautiful when also human.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Neptune', 'Aquarius', $$Your imagination comes through technological and ideological visions. You fantasize about future utopias and humanitarian ideals. Your inspiration is revolutionary and humanitarian. Your creativity flows through ideas.$$, $$You''re drawn to futuristic vision and humanitarian ideals. Your imagination is expansive. You dream of enlightened societies and technology for good. You can be delusional about what''s possible. Your vision is inspired and radical. Your ideas transform thinking.$$, $$You''re attracted to visionary, unconventional partners. You idealize them as spiritually matched. You merge intellectually and ideologically. You can be emotionally vague. Your love is idealistic and merged. You''re blind to real needs.$$, $$Your fantasy about utopia is delusional. Your idealism is disconnected from real people. Your vagueness about emotions creates distance. Your vision alienates people. Your inspiration is escapism.$$, $$Ground your vision in present reality. Connect emotionally with actual people. See partners clearly, not as projections of ideals. Distinguish between inspiration and delusion. Understand that real change includes human care. Your vision is powerful when grounded. Your idealism is beautiful when also compassionate.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

('Neptune', 'Pisces', $$Your imagination comes through boundless spiritual and creative dreams. You fantasize about transcendence and cosmic union. Your inspiration is mystical and boundless. Your creativity flows through all dimensions.$$, $$You''re drawn to spirituality and creativity without limits. Your imagination dissolves boundaries. You dream of cosmic consciousness and artistic perfection. You can be delusional about reality. Your art is transcendent and moving. Your spirituality is boundless.$$, $$You''re attracted to spiritual, artistic partners. You idealize them as soulmate. You merge completely and boundary-less. You can be unclear about your own reality. Your love is spiritual merger. You''re blind to dysfunction.$$, $$Your fantasy prevents real living. Your boundlessness means no identity. Your merger is codependency. Your escapism into spirituality enables dysfunction. Your faith is delusional.$$, $$Set firm boundaries around spirituality and art. Maintain your identity in partnership. Face practical reality. Distinguish between inspiration and delusion. Understand that enlightenment includes being grounded. Your transcendence is powerful when also real. Your spirituality is beautiful when also boundaried.$$, $$ARRAY[''Woolfolk, The Only Astrology Book You''''ll Ever Need'', ''Hand, Planets in Transit'']$$),

